 Looks like you have taken the shot through your own eyes after having first consumed a large portion of the shop''s contents :o)</td>', 'Really like the shot.  Inventive Looks like you have taken the shot through your own eyes after having first consumed a large portion of the shop''s contents :o)', '2002-09-16 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122095, 5637, 1041, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this photo does not qualify for negative space in my opinion, there''s too much going on in the background.  you are even pointing that out in the title.  as for the photo, i like the distorted fisheye view, but the stain or scratches on the gumball machine is distracting.  i would also suggest cropping your photos tighter when you use that lens (and that means composing the photo so you can loose the edges) so that the ''rounded corners'' from the lens aren''t visible. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'sorry, but this photo does not qualify for negative space in my opinion, there''s too much going on in the background.  you are even pointing that out in the title.  as for the photo, i like the distorted fisheye view, but the stain or scratches on the gumball machine is distracting.  i would also suggest cropping your photos tighter when you use that lens (and that means composing the photo so you can loose the edges) so that the ''rounded corners'' from the lens aren''t visible. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
