(122147, 5652, 82, '<td valign="top">This one enchants me like a tongue twister (fun to say, fun to look at, grasps the attention many times).  In this photo, the negative space -- the yellow surrounding the silhouette -- seeps into my perception of the subject itself, which carries some of its texture.  The golden color appeals to me, and the swirls in the glass are as inviting as those in the Van Gogh "Starry Night."  The shadows in the upper left and right transform the gold into a kind of halo.  Very, very nice.  8</td>', 'This one enchants me like a tongue twister (fun to say, fun to look at, grasps the attention many times).  In this photo, the negative space -- the yellow surrounding the silhouette -- seeps into my perception of the subject itself, which carries some of its texture.  The golden color appeals to me, and the swirls in the glass are as inviting as those in the Van Gogh "Starry Night."  The shadows in the upper left and right transform the gold into a kind of halo.  Very, very nice.  8', '2002-09-20 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
