(122157, 5656, 1041, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry, but i don''t see this as a negative space picture, there''s entirely too much going on throughout the whole photo.  as for the photo itself, i love the colors, it''s borderline abstract, but you can recognize it.  very nice.  i would probably try and crop out the bud at the top right, and (if that''s possible w/out loosing too much of the photo) the purple leaf at the bottom right.  definitely the bud though. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'i''m sorry, but i don''t see this as a negative space picture, there''s entirely too much going on throughout the whole photo.  as for the photo itself, i love the colors, it''s borderline abstract, but you can recognize it.  very nice.  i would probably try and crop out the bud at the top right, and (if that''s possible w/out loosing too much of the photo) the purple leaf at the bottom right.  definitely the bud though. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1);
