(123767, 5788, 3161, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space - nice tones. Pity there were ripples in the water around the reflection of the head.</td>', 'Good use of negative space - nice tones. Pity there were ripples in the water around the reflection of the head.', '2002-09-19 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123768, 5788, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely done shot.  A comment I made on a few others, which I''ll do here too, is that I really like the fact that you didn''t try to do something with one plain, empty background because while the space is "negative" it''s not effective.  Your framing of the water and shore really good and since the Egret (?) is about the same color as the shore it pulls the eye down through the photo to follow the reflection.  Really nice.<br/>Score: 9<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'This is a nicely done shot.  A comment I made on a few others, which I''ll do here too, is that I really like the fact that you didn''t try to do something with one plain, empty background because while the space is "negative" it''s not effective.  Your framing of the water and shore really good and since the Egret (?) is about the same color as the shore it pulls the eye down through the photo to follow the reflection.  Really nice.Score: 9Courtenay', '2002-09-19 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123769, 5788, 2125, '<td valign="top">cool 9</td>', 'cool 9', '2002-09-20 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
