(123793, 5789, 1041, '<td valign="top">i''m not too thrilled with the title, but then, this is not a title contest.  as for use of negative space, i think you''ve used it very well, better than many (including myself) in the challenge. the composition is great, and even though there are a couple of specs in the photo, i know how hard aquarium (or under water?) photography is, and it''s nothing you can''t fix once the challenge is over.  i love the yellow and blue colors.  definitely in my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10).</td>', 'i''m not too thrilled with the title, but then, this is not a title contest.  as for use of negative space, i think you''ve used it very well, better than many (including myself) in the challenge. the composition is great, and even though there are a couple of specs in the photo, i know how hard aquarium (or under water?) photography is, and it''s nothing you can''t fix once the challenge is over.  i love the yellow and blue colors.  definitely in my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10).', '2002-09-16 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
