(123806, 5789, 2295, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I love the color.  focus looks great.  Lighting looks great.  Good use of negative space.  9</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I love the color.  focus looks great.  Lighting looks great.  Good use of negative space.  9', '2002-09-17 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123807, 5789, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent colors!   good focus for such a low light shot!  i like how the one in the back seems like a satellite of the other .. unique in that the neg space isnt the same color as many.  as a marine biologist, i find this pic intriguing .. did u push the saturation on these moon jellies?  the ones ive seen havent been so yellow.  too bad about your hot pixels ;) .. mag99.</td>', 'excellent colors!   good focus for such a low light shot!  i like how the one in the back seems like a satellite of the other .. unique in that the neg space isnt the same color as many.  as a marine biologist, i find this pic intriguing .. did u push the saturation on these moon jellies?  the ones ive seen havent been so yellow.  too bad about your hot pixels ;) .. mag99.', '2002-09-17 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123808, 5789, 3982, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m right in there beside them. Love the yellow against the blue. Maybe taking just a little off the top would make them appear even closer.</td>', 'I feel like I''m right in there beside them. Love the yellow against the blue. Maybe taking just a little off the top would make them appear even closer.', '2002-09-18 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
