(123817, 5789, 51167, '<td valign="top">I always wondered how people get pictures of them lit up like this.  When I lived in Okinawa one of the beaches had a ton of jellyfish in the water and the where just ugly brown things.  This one is beautiful.  Is this taken at an aquarium or with underwater stuff for your camera?  I''ll just have to find out on Sunday. 8</td>', 'I always wondered how people get pictures of them lit up like this.  When I lived in Okinawa one of the beaches had a ton of jellyfish in the water and the where just ugly brown things.  This one is beautiful.  Is this taken at an aquarium or with underwater stuff for your camera?  I''ll just have to find out on Sunday. 8', '2002-09-19 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123818, 5789, 1856, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors!  Great composition and use of negative space.  The plankton above the jellyfish is a little ''noisy-looking.''  For some reason it doesn''t bother me when it''s below the jelly but it does when it''s above..go figure :P  9 Lisa</td>', 'Incredible colors!  Great composition and use of negative space.  The plankton above the jellyfish is a little ''noisy-looking.''  For some reason it doesn''t bother me when it''s below the jelly but it does when it''s above..go figure :P  9 Lisa', '2002-09-19 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123819, 5789, 1019, '<td valign="top">I love these jellyfish--I''m not sure whether they are the same as the ones in Cape Town if not they look very similar and they are so hard to photograph well---so very well done---andrewm</td>', 'I love these jellyfish--I''m not sure whether they are the same as the ones in Cape Town if not they look very similar and they are so hard to photograph well---so very well done---andrewm', '2002-09-19 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
