(124731, 5847, 2172, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT  - can I say WOW, Great lighting and composition.  As I look at this, I think, does the neg space emphasize this....YES, it is what really makes this pic work.  On one hand, I think that the marbles(?) should be more equal...but on the other hand they don''t - the unevenness (if that''s a word) brings a little more personality to the pic.  Wonderful job!!   10<br/>Ruthann     One of my TOP TOP 10, would give this an 11 If I could<br/>(updated)</td>', 'EXCELLENT  - can I say WOW, Great lighting and composition.  As I look at this, I think, does the neg space emphasize this....YES, it is what really makes this pic work.  On one hand, I think that the marbles(?) should be more equal...but on the other hand they don''t - the unevenness (if that''s a word) brings a little more personality to the pic.  Wonderful job!!   10Ruthann     One of my TOP TOP 10, would give this an 11 If I could(updated)', '2002-09-16 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
