(124752, 5847, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clean, sharp and reasonably striking. Nice composition, good that it''s not exactly a mirror image within the frame. Not sure it''s one I could spend hours looking at, but nice contrasts and highlights.<br/>Is that your Go pieces? Or Othello?<br/>6, Kavey<br/></td>', 'Clean, sharp and reasonably striking. Nice composition, good that it''s not exactly a mirror image within the frame. Not sure it''s one I could spend hours looking at, but nice contrasts and highlights.Is that your Go pieces? Or Othello?6, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
