(124760, 5848, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo.  I really don''t see much negative space however. Perhaps if you had shot it from a lower angle where the sky was the only negative space or from higher up where the muted colors of the land were the only negative space.  But the line separating sky from land really breaks up the negativeness to me.</td>', 'Very cool photo.  I really don''t see much negative space however. Perhaps if you had shot it from a lower angle where the sky was the only negative space or from higher up where the muted colors of the land were the only negative space.  But the line separating sky from land really breaks up the negativeness to me.', '2002-09-16 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
