(124842, 5852, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the need for the admin. not here.  I think that this is pretty self explanitory.  The duck looks like it is swimming in a body of water that is overgrown with algea.  maybe it''s a real duck, maybe it''s not, but does it matter?  personally, I like it.  great use of neg. space.  good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'I don''t understand the need for the admin. not here.  I think that this is pretty self explanitory.  The duck looks like it is swimming in a body of water that is overgrown with algea.  maybe it''s a real duck, maybe it''s not, but does it matter?  personally, I like it.  great use of neg. space.  good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-09-23 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124843, 5852, 2199, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the interesting comments on this photo. I guess quite a few voters thought there might have been some Photoshop trickery. This duck was swimming in a swampy area, with lots of algae growing on the surface of the water. I agree that the result looks a little odd -- kinda like the duck is stuck in asphalt! No Photoshop tricks required here, just a duck swimming in a swamp looking for food......Alan</td>', 'Thanks for all of the interesting comments on this photo. I guess quite a few voters thought there might have been some Photoshop trickery. This duck was swimming in a swampy area, with lots of algae growing on the surface of the water. I agree that the result looks a little odd -- kinda like the duck is stuck in asphalt! No Photoshop tricks required here, just a duck swimming in a swamp looking for food......Alan', '2002-09-23 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(124844, 5853, 3044, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. wonderful example of neg space. my only suggestion would be to maybe have hannah''s whole head in the frame. just over a little bit more from where it is. still a magnificant shot. great work. 10 goodtimecharlee</td>', 'beautiful shot. wonderful example of neg space. my only suggestion would be to maybe have hannah''s whole head in the frame. just over a little bit more from where it is. still a magnificant shot. great work. 10 goodtimecharlee', '2002-09-16 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
