(124870, 5853, 2798, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT framing and lovely contrasts. Looks a little over sharpened on the bottom of her arm - I see a white fringe. Overall, though, superb. 9 - floyd</td>', 'EXCELLENT framing and lovely contrasts. Looks a little over sharpened on the bottom of her arm - I see a white fringe. Overall, though, superb. 9 - floyd', '2002-09-18 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124871, 5853, 3724, '<td valign="top">At first I thought a 5, just another gobbler picture.......  but the arm extended to the right into the dark (your negative space) with the little finger pointing up  is a unique expression captured.  Seven.</td>', 'At first I thought a 5, just another gobbler picture.......  but the arm extended to the right into the dark (your negative space) with the little finger pointing up  is a unique expression captured.  Seven.', '2002-09-18 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124872, 5853, 811, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I think the "negative space" on the right does a good job of focusing the eyes on the childs face.  What i really like though, is how the frame looks like it is tilting her head for her.  Does that make sense.  Like she is pushed all the way against the edge.  You captured a great expression, as well.  Sorry if you get grief for "kid pics" -- I like this one. karmat</td>', 'I like this shot.  I think the "negative space" on the right does a good job of focusing the eyes on the childs face.  What i really like though, is how the frame looks like it is tilting her head for her.  Does that make sense.  Like she is pushed all the way against the edge.  You captured a great expression, as well.  Sorry if you get grief for "kid pics" -- I like this one. karmat', '2002-09-18 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124873, 5853, 714, '<td valign="top">Hey Zeissman,  Nice picture.  She is adorable.  10</td>', 'Hey Zeissman,  Nice picture.  She is adorable.  10', '2002-09-18 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124874, 5853, 1707, '<td valign="top">sweet baby</td>', 'sweet baby', '2002-09-19 05:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124875, 5853, 3730, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great contrast. Wish there was a bit more ''subtle'' contrast on the negative space so that it doesn''t look so ''black''. I think that would help tell the story of where this baby is. Focus seems a tad soft...but I like it. 7 -zadore</td>', 'Great shot, great contrast. Wish there was a bit more ''subtle'' contrast on the negative space so that it doesn''t look so ''black''. I think that would help tell the story of where this baby is. Focus seems a tad soft...but I like it. 7 -zadore', '2002-09-19 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124876, 5853, 1856, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pic...wish i had one of my son like this!  I love everything about it...priceless expression...looks like she''s saying ''i''ve got you wrapped around my little pinky!'' 9 Lisa</td>', 'Beautiful pic...wish i had one of my son like this!  I love everything about it...priceless expression...looks like she''s saying ''i''ve got you wrapped around my little pinky!'' 9 Lisa', '2002-09-19 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124877, 5853, 1019, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait--well done   andrewm</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait--well done   andrewm', '2002-09-19 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124878, 5853, 82, '<td valign="top">You have captured an adorable baby in a pose balanced between awkward and graceful.  Something about the extended pinky adds interest to me, suggesting future sophistication (the way some people drink wine) and future language (lettering in Sign).  At first, I wanted the background to be stark black, but the hints of velvet-highlight are ultimately okay with me.  They are a little like the lines a cartoonist draws around a subject to suggest movement.  The negative space in this case swirls my eye around the hand, then tosses me back to the rewarding image of such a cutie.  I would have preferred more contrast in the baby, but you caught a wonderful expression.  8</td>', 'You have captured an adorable baby in a pose balanced between awkward and graceful.  Something about the extended pinky adds interest to me, suggesting future sophistication (the way some people drink wine) and future language (lettering in Sign).  At first, I wanted the background to be stark black, but the hints of velvet-highlight are ultimately okay with me.  They are a little like the lines a cartoonist draws around a subject to suggest movement.  The negative space in this case swirls my eye around the hand, then tosses me back to the rewarding image of such a cutie.  I would have preferred more contrast in the baby, but you caught a wonderful expression.  8', '2002-09-20 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124879, 5853, 2123, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  I like how she''s placed in the frame...my eye starts at her face and travels right up to her little pinkie.  8  kathleenm</td>', 'What a cutie!  I like how she''s placed in the frame...my eye starts at her face and travels right up to her little pinkie.  8  kathleenm', '2002-09-20 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124880, 5853, 3955, '<td valign="top">medium good</td>', 'medium good', '2002-09-20 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124881, 5853, 3313, '<td valign="top">What a pretty baby ! The composition is great !</td>', 'What a pretty baby ! The composition is great !', '2002-09-21 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124882, 5853, 656, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - great contrast with the background - excellent expression and framing.  Only issue is it seems a bit soft focused on the eyes - maybe worth experiementing with setting the focus on the eyes and reframing, if you don''t already do that, or maybe different sharpening settings 10 - Gordon</td>', 'Fantastic - great contrast with the background - excellent expression and framing.  Only issue is it seems a bit soft focused on the eyes - maybe worth experiementing with setting the focus on the eyes and reframing, if you don''t already do that, or maybe different sharpening settings 10 - Gordon', '2002-09-21 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124883, 5853, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am not usually a fan of baby shots at all, nor do I usually mark them highly, so this is an exception for me.<br/>The shapes here are just fantastic. The angle of her head, and the way her arm pushes into the negative space are exactly right. Makes for a great composition. The highlights in her eyes are great and you''ve caught her hint of a smile so well. There''s a little too much blow out in the highlights of her skin, but not massively so.<br/>Great shot!<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'I am not usually a fan of baby shots at all, nor do I usually mark them highly, so this is an exception for me.The shapes here are just fantastic. The angle of her head, and the way her arm pushes into the negative space are exactly right. Makes for a great composition. The highlights in her eyes are great and you''ve caught her hint of a smile so well. There''s a little too much blow out in the highlights of her skin, but not massively so.Great shot!9, Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124884, 5853, 1031, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait...in the context of this challenge I want her hand/pinkie to be the focus -- I might have tried to draw attention to it by calling the photo "Etiquette Lesson" or putting a tiny (doll''s?) teacup in her hand. Then let her arm lead to her wonderful eyes and expression as the "positive" element.</td>', 'A nice portrait...in the context of this challenge I want her hand/pinkie to be the focus -- I might have tried to draw attention to it by calling the photo "Etiquette Lesson" or putting a tiny (doll''s?) teacup in her hand. Then let her arm lead to her wonderful eyes and expression as the "positive" element.', '2002-09-21 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124885, 5853, 2173, '<td valign="top">nice shot, beautiful baby!! 8</td>', 'nice shot, beautiful baby!! 8', '2002-09-21 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124886, 5853, 2834, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it''s been said before and I''ll say it again: beautiful baby!  Nice clarity.  How did you get her to raise her pinkie just so?  8</td>', 'I''m sure it''s been said before and I''ll say it again: beautiful baby!  Nice clarity.  How did you get her to raise her pinkie just so?  8', '2002-09-21 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
