 I really like this, first class composition, well executed and the use of B&amp;W works well to produce a great sense of drama.  First 10 of the challenge</td>', 'Stunning shot I really like this, first class composition, well executed and the use of B&W works well to produce a great sense of drama.  First 10 of the challenge', '2002-09-16 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125256, 5878, 1175, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the feeling of defiance here.  Probably because of the angle of the photo.  I get a cold... lonely... mentally unstable feeling from this.  With the camera looking down the person looks small and all those feelings I mentioned in the last sentence.  The feet and stance are a part of body language.  Her feet are parallel which doesn''t give a great feeling of balance.  Actually it feels uncomfortable.<br/><br/>To do defiance I''d think it would be better with a lower camera angle.  With a view of the defiant face looking out of the frame, as the model is doing in this one.  Also the feet should probably be angled outward for a more stable stance.</td>', 'I don''t really get the feeling of defiance here.  Probably because of the angle of the photo.  I get a cold... lonely... mentally unstable feeling from this.  With the camera looking down the person looks small and all those feelings I mentioned in the last sentence.  The feet and stance are a part of body language.  Her feet are parallel which doesn''t give a great feeling of balance.  Actually it feels uncomfortable.To do defiance I''d think it would be better with a lower camera angle.  With a view of the defiant face looking out of the frame, as the model is doing in this one.  Also the feet should probably be angled outward for a more stable stance.', '2002-09-16 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
