(125342, 5882, 3161, '<td valign="top">Very clever - really jumps out at you! I wish there was no thin grey line around our photos when they are displayed for us to judge - yours would otherwise be even more powerful, I think! - not your fault, I know! :) I do like the use of neg space here - a good example of where a single color is more effective in a negative space than a texture or other treatment.</td>', 'Very clever - really jumps out at you! I wish there was no thin grey line around our photos when they are displayed for us to judge - yours would otherwise be even more powerful, I think! - not your fault, I know! :) I do like the use of neg space here - a good example of where a single color is more effective in a negative space than a texture or other treatment.', '2002-09-19 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
