(126278, 5941, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was done with a mirror in the darkness.  Really cool effect.  I think though that the centering may be off slightly.  Probably due to having to adjust angles to keep reflection and glare off the mirror.  I really like the melted front of the candle so we can see the flame.  I may have liked to see the flame straight upward, but I think it is also good the way it is.  I really like the use of the neg. space.  the lighting is perfect for the effect chosen.  the framing is really good.  overall really nice.  Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'This looks like it was done with a mirror in the darkness.  Really cool effect.  I think though that the centering may be off slightly.  Probably due to having to adjust angles to keep reflection and glare off the mirror.  I really like the melted front of the candle so we can see the flame.  I may have liked to see the flame straight upward, but I think it is also good the way it is.  I really like the use of the neg. space.  the lighting is perfect for the effect chosen.  the framing is really good.  overall really nice.  Good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-09-17 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
