(126315, 5943, 772, '<td valign="top">wow... grace is beautiful :)  This looks like a portrait that I would expect to see as one of those huge oil paintings hanging along a winding staircase in a mansion somewhere... the light on her face makes me wonder what she is looking at... the most intriguing piece of this photo for me is the soft focus.  This is a perfect example of how soft focus should be used... did you focus this way or did you use a soft filter?  I would love to hear more about how this was done :) = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow... grace is beautiful :)  This looks like a portrait that I would expect to see as one of those huge oil paintings hanging along a winding staircase in a mansion somewhere... the light on her face makes me wonder what she is looking at... the most intriguing piece of this photo for me is the soft focus.  This is a perfect example of how soft focus should be used... did you focus this way or did you use a soft filter?  I would love to hear more about how this was done :) = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-17 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
