(121769, 5608, 3982, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this photo I thought that the focus was the lights and/or the tower...but after staring at it awhile the focus became the burnt out light and the rest just made it better for me. I think it fits with the challenge of making the negative space around the object be a wow. I really like this the more I look at it.</td>', 'When I first looked at this photo I thought that the focus was the lights and/or the tower...but after staring at it awhile the focus became the burnt out light and the rest just made it better for me. I think it fits with the challenge of making the negative space around the object be a wow. I really like this the more I look at it.', '2002-09-18 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
