(121773, 5608, 3112, '<td valign="top">Outstanding color!  The Ferris wheel is an unfortunate intruder into the frame.  But, when you shoot situations as they occur, we take what we get, right?  Technically, a wonderful shot.  9 overall - mjcecil</td>', 'Outstanding color!  The Ferris wheel is an unfortunate intruder into the frame.  But, when you shoot situations as they occur, we take what we get, right?  Technically, a wonderful shot.  9 overall - mjcecil', '2002-09-19 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121774, 5608, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! That burned out bulb is very interesting but I really like the sharpness and the lack of noise</td>', 'Beautifully done! That burned out bulb is very interesting but I really like the sharpness and the lack of noise', '2002-09-19 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121775, 5608, 82, '<td valign="top">To me, more than anything, this is a beautiful swash of abstract color.  The shot is well composed, and the negative space is a gorgeous gradient blue that highlights the orange.  The spaces between the light bulb wire are interesting and want to tooth into the ferris wheel like gears.  10</td>', 'To me, more than anything, this is a beautiful swash of abstract color.  The shot is well composed, and the negative space is a gorgeous gradient blue that highlights the orange.  The spaces between the light bulb wire are interesting and want to tooth into the ferris wheel like gears.  10', '2002-09-20 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121776, 5608, 3955, '<td valign="top">gee, you could have changed the lightbulb first (ha ha, just kidding!)<br/><br/>Nicely done, I might have cropped the ferris wheel out, it is distracting.</td>', 'gee, you could have changed the lightbulb first (ha ha, just kidding!)Nicely done, I might have cropped the ferris wheel out, it is distracting.', '2002-09-20 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
