(121780, 5608, 2427, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - good colors, subject, balance.<br/>I guess the only thing I''m not quite sure about is the inclusion of the ferris wheel.<br/>It''s very cool but I''m not sure if it helps this photo.  It might be enough w/ just the lights and the pole. <br/>Overall though still a good photo.</td>', 'I really like this photo - good colors, subject, balance.I guess the only thing I''m not quite sure about is the inclusion of the ferris wheel.It''s very cool but I''m not sure if it helps this photo.  It might be enough w/ just the lights and the pole. Overall though still a good photo.', '2002-09-22 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121781, 5611, 1143, '<td valign="top">REALLY great work. It''s so artsy fartsy. Looks like gallery material to me. Can I have a print with a black mat pleeeease?  9  ~indigo997</td>', 'REALLY great work. It''s so artsy fartsy. Looks like gallery material to me. Can I have a print with a black mat pleeeease?  9  ~indigo997', '2002-09-16 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(121782, 5611, 3208, '<td valign="top">Now this an excellent photo because it has atmosphere and it evokes curiosity...  ''Where is this place?  What does the darkness lead to? etc.''  I like the contrast between the over exposed whiteness of the walls and the darkness.  Also, good use of neg. space.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Now this an excellent photo because it has atmosphere and it evokes curiosity...  ''Where is this place?  What does the darkness lead to? etc.''  I like the contrast between the over exposed whiteness of the walls and the darkness.  Also, good use of neg. space.  Excellent work!', '2002-09-16 03:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
