(121817, 5613, 3112, '<td valign="top">Up: Excellent color.  Good subject.  Down:  Barely-exposed church details beg for either more light for detail, or less exposure to make it a total silhouette.  Also, could benefit from sharp focus on the church, and stopped down lens to get big DOF...  As-is, the church shows very soft focus.</td>', 'Up: Excellent color.  Good subject.  Down:  Barely-exposed church details beg for either more light for detail, or less exposure to make it a total silhouette.  Also, could benefit from sharp focus on the church, and stopped down lens to get big DOF...  As-is, the church shows very soft focus.', '2002-09-16 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
