(121984, 5624, 3982, '<td valign="top">I think I like the idea behind this. There isn''t a waterfall but the trees on the water make it look as if it were a waterfall...right?  Good thinking about negative space but I''m not a fan of the out of focus look on this photo.</td>', 'I think I like the idea behind this. There isn''t a waterfall but the trees on the water make it look as if it were a waterfall...right?  Good thinking about negative space but I''m not a fan of the out of focus look on this photo.', '2002-09-19 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
