(122003, 5625, 3575, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on finding the subject! This is really a great shot -- there is a lot of stuff in the background but it qualifies as negative space because none of it takes away from the subject. Way cool.</td>', 'Congratulations on finding the subject! This is really a great shot -- there is a lot of stuff in the background but it qualifies as negative space because none of it takes away from the subject. Way cool.', '2002-09-16 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
