(122006, 5625, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice coyote picture.  I know how hard it is to get some of these animal pictures.  Too bad he was in the shadows, would have looked much better in the light.</td>', 'Nice coyote picture.  I know how hard it is to get some of these animal pictures.  Too bad he was in the shadows, would have looked much better in the light.', '2002-09-17 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
