(122179, 5656, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  You seem to have an interpretation of negative space i have not seen.  I am interesting in hearing about it.  5 -- karmat</td>', 'Nice colors.  You seem to have an interpretation of negative space i have not seen.  I am interesting in hearing about it.  5 -- karmat', '2002-09-22 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
