(122188, 5660, 1041, '<td valign="top">sorry, but in my mind, this does not qualify as a negative space photo, there is too much going on in the background.  as for the photo, because of the shadow and black fur, details in the dog''s head are hard to pick out, and the head &amp; eyes are generally very important to portrait. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'sorry, but in my mind, this does not qualify as a negative space photo, there is too much going on in the background.  as for the photo, because of the shadow and black fur, details in the dog''s head are hard to pick out, and the head & eyes are generally very important to portrait. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
