(122221, 5664, 3669, '<td valign="top">This made me squint when it popped on my screen.  I suppose that''s what happens when you look into the sun.  Nice being able to capture the "halo" around the sun.  Although I''m not entirely sure what the exact thing we look for in negative space, I''m having problems determining it in this picture.  A lot of things are going on in it.</td>', 'This made me squint when it popped on my screen.  I suppose that''s what happens when you look into the sun.  Nice being able to capture the "halo" around the sun.  Although I''m not entirely sure what the exact thing we look for in negative space, I''m having problems determining it in this picture.  A lot of things are going on in it.', '2002-09-16 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
