(122244, 5673, 2172, '<td valign="top">Excellent, great work  Great use of neg space. (maybe could''ve been cropped just a tad more).  As I look at this, I think, does the neg space do anything to the subject?  I say YES, (I took paper and placed it over the neg space area)  Without the neg space, you get just the window part and not the effect of perhaps laying on the floor in a dark room, "gazing into heaven"  (although I may have called it DayDreaming-but what''s the diff)  The angle is great as well as the colors of the sky.  Great contrast, really brings out the sky.  Wonderful job.  10<br/>Ruthann<br/>(updated)</td>', 'Excellent, great work  Great use of neg space. (maybe could''ve been cropped just a tad more).  As I look at this, I think, does the neg space do anything to the subject?  I say YES, (I took paper and placed it over the neg space area)  Without the neg space, you get just the window part and not the effect of perhaps laying on the floor in a dark room, "gazing into heaven"  (although I may have called it DayDreaming-but what''s the diff)  The angle is great as well as the colors of the sky.  Great contrast, really brings out the sky.  Wonderful job.  10Ruthann(updated)', '2002-09-16 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
