(122350, 5682, 3902, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out what this was, but I''m glad I figured it out, excellent!</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out what this was, but I''m glad I figured it out, excellent!', '2002-09-18 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
