(122355, 5682, 1360, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  Strangely enough, I notice the security camera in the lower left, looking out "over the sky".  I dont know if it was intentional, but this picture seems to make a statement about our ever-shrinking, real freedoms.... 7 -lennier</td>', 'I like this image.  Strangely enough, I notice the security camera in the lower left, looking out "over the sky".  I dont know if it was intentional, but this picture seems to make a statement about our ever-shrinking, real freedoms.... 7 -lennier', '2002-09-19 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
