(122361, 5686, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I like it very much. Tones are mostly good, maybe a tad bit dark. Good luck to you. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Cool shot. I like it very much. Tones are mostly good, maybe a tad bit dark. Good luck to you. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-16 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122362, 5686, 1280, '<td valign="top">LOL  I know the feeling here!   A little more contrast and brightness would improve this.  It certainly meets the challenge!  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'LOL  I know the feeling here!   A little more contrast and brightness would improve this.  It certainly meets the challenge!  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122363, 5686, 3080, '<td valign="top">This might have a higher visual impact if the creases were less noticable.  With the title, you make it seem like the fine print is the subject.  If the fine print were in fact the subject, then it would technically be the positive space.  However, not being technical, the hand it''s self being the "subject" lacks in interest, and the background, brings it in to be interesting.  So in that case, I think you did a fine job of portraying "negative space" If that makes any sense. lol.   Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This might have a higher visual impact if the creases were less noticable.  With the title, you make it seem like the fine print is the subject.  If the fine print were in fact the subject, then it would technically be the positive space.  However, not being technical, the hand it''s self being the "subject" lacks in interest, and the background, brings it in to be interesting.  So in that case, I think you did a fine job of portraying "negative space" If that makes any sense. lol.   Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122364, 5686, 3724, '<td valign="top">Very subtle picture............   i love the folded paper shadow grid creating a mnimal negative space.</td>', 'Very subtle picture............   i love the folded paper shadow grid creating a mnimal negative space.', '2002-09-16 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
