(122413, 5689, 2152, '<td valign="top">This is a very dramatic shot.  I like how you framed it with the house and fences, but I wish the trees on the left weren''t there.  Short of cutting them down, I guess there wasn''t much you could do though. ;)  Also, some more seperation between the fence on the right and the bridge would have been nice, but that''s just nitpicking.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is a very dramatic shot.  I like how you framed it with the house and fences, but I wish the trees on the left weren''t there.  Short of cutting them down, I guess there wasn''t much you could do though. ;)  Also, some more seperation between the fence on the right and the bridge would have been nice, but that''s just nitpicking.  Nice job.', '2002-09-21 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
