(122518, 5694, 3208, '<td valign="top">This seems strange to me, sort of cold, soul-less even.  You need people in the photo to create feeling.  How about a sillhouette visible against the passing train?  However, I must give you credit for trying an imaginative way of using neg. space.</td>', 'This seems strange to me, sort of cold, soul-less even.  You need people in the photo to create feeling.  How about a sillhouette visible against the passing train?  However, I must give you credit for trying an imaginative way of using neg. space.', '2002-09-16 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
