(122607, 5706, 3880, '<td valign="top">It has a nice feel to it.  I don''t see the negative space, though</td>', 'It has a nice feel to it.  I don''t see the negative space, though', '2002-09-17 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122608, 5706, 1154, '<td valign="top">My favorite pic in this challenge, not to mention it is a perfect exsample of negative space.</td>', 'My favorite pic in this challenge, not to mention it is a perfect exsample of negative space.', '2002-09-17 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122609, 5706, 3846, '<td valign="top">Good,  very good.  Great use of shadows</td>', 'Good,  very good.  Great use of shadows', '2002-09-17 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122610, 5706, 3102, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!  This is just great -- a 10 all the way.</td>', 'Spectacular!  This is just great -- a 10 all the way.', '2002-09-17 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122611, 5706, 3982, '<td valign="top">love the colors.</td>', 'love the colors.', '2002-09-18 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122612, 5706, 3802, '<td valign="top">an excellent monochromatic image!</td>', 'an excellent monochromatic image!', '2002-09-18 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122613, 5706, 2781, '<td valign="top">great color!</td>', 'great color!', '2002-09-18 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122614, 5706, 3887, '<td valign="top">The colors are absolutely  beautiful. I don''t know if it fits with the challenge or not, but I really like the colors.</td>', 'The colors are absolutely  beautiful. I don''t know if it fits with the challenge or not, but I really like the colors.', '2002-09-18 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122615, 5706, 1707, '<td valign="top">ahhh, simply classic.  Did you use a filter?</td>', 'ahhh, simply classic.  Did you use a filter?', '2002-09-19 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122616, 5706, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting here.</td>', 'Love the lighting here.', '2002-09-19 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122617, 5706, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love the colors - so warm and inviting.  The composition is great.  I love the focus (just curious, what it would like like in b/w...not that I don''t love it the way it is)  The flower appears as if it is floating.  There''s only one thing that bothers me (and I''m sure you''ve heard it already) is the bottom left corner, it appears that it was over contrasted/sharpened...Why this bothers me, because the rest of the image is so smooth and flowing and the speckles take away from that....this is my reaction.  Anyway...This is a wall hanger.  Oh, Yes the neg space definately affects the impact of this image!!   Great work  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great shot!  I love the colors - so warm and inviting.  The composition is great.  I love the focus (just curious, what it would like like in b/w...not that I don''t love it the way it is)  The flower appears as if it is floating.  There''s only one thing that bothers me (and I''m sure you''ve heard it already) is the bottom left corner, it appears that it was over contrasted/sharpened...Why this bothers me, because the rest of the image is so smooth and flowing and the speckles take away from that....this is my reaction.  Anyway...This is a wall hanger.  Oh, Yes the neg space definately affects the impact of this image!!   Great work  9Ruthann', '2002-09-19 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122618, 5706, 875, '<td valign="top">Beatiful colors and fantastic depth of focus.</td>', 'Beatiful colors and fantastic depth of focus.', '2002-09-19 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122619, 5706, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done in complementary colors and meets the challenge so well.  Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Beautifully done in complementary colors and meets the challenge so well.  Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-20 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122620, 5706, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and I like the DOF on the slats.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Great colours and I like the DOF on the slats.7, Kavey', '2002-09-20 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122621, 5706, 3955, '<td valign="top">background is a little too grainy/texturey to be a good ''neg space'' pic</td>', 'background is a little too grainy/texturey to be a good ''neg space'' pic', '2002-09-20 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122622, 5706, 3112, '<td valign="top">ooey-gooey!  I love it.  It is a strangely sharp dropoff of focus field after the flower, which almost makes it look false. I might have stopped down one or two to get a smoother perspective fade. 8.5 doesn''t exist, so 9 will do. - mjcecil</td>', 'ooey-gooey!  I love it.  It is a strangely sharp dropoff of focus field after the flower, which almost makes it look false. I might have stopped down one or two to get a smoother perspective fade. 8.5 doesn''t exist, so 9 will do. - mjcecil', '2002-09-20 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122623, 5706, 656, '<td valign="top">subtle and effective.  lovely warm tones</td>', 'subtle and effective.  lovely warm tones', '2002-09-21 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
