(122773, 5717, 3112, '<td valign="top">I might have been inclined to shoot this one in BW, as the dead plants are integral to the lonely image of the tree, and BW tends to emphasize that broken feeling.</td>', 'I might have been inclined to shoot this one in BW, as the dead plants are integral to the lonely image of the tree, and BW tends to emphasize that broken feeling.', '2002-09-21 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
