(122794, 5718, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  My only complaint would be that it''s a bit dark for me.  Your subject matter is great.  Focus looks good.  I''m not too sure about the "negative space" in this one.  8</td>', 'Very nicely done.  My only complaint would be that it''s a bit dark for me.  Your subject matter is great.  Focus looks good.  I''m not too sure about the "negative space" in this one.  8', '2002-09-18 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122795, 5718, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think (IMHO) that a better link to negative space would be for the reflection in the mirror to be as shown with all the interest, and the background behind it to be completely empty, no trees, as little of anything as possible, preferably all sky. I don''t imagine that would be easy, just a suggestion in terms of what would make this more relevant for me. I appreciate this comment is according to my own definitions of neg space and your mileage may vary.<br/>5, Kavey<br/></td>', 'I think (IMHO) that a better link to negative space would be for the reflection in the mirror to be as shown with all the interest, and the background behind it to be completely empty, no trees, as little of anything as possible, preferably all sky. I don''t imagine that would be easy, just a suggestion in terms of what would make this more relevant for me. I appreciate this comment is according to my own definitions of neg space and your mileage may vary.5, Kavey', '2002-09-18 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(122796, 5718, 3549, '<td valign="top">nice pic but a reflection isn''t negative space, in my opinion</td>', 'nice pic but a reflection isn''t negative space, in my opinion', '2002-09-18 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
