(122896, 5725, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of detail, and i like the simplicity of the colors.  Two suggestions, though, that in my opinion, would make it a little stronger, mayber.  First, move the flower over just a touch so tha tyou can''t see the black between the petals in the middle.  Okay, one suggestion, cause then i think that might eliminate cropping the petals out on the right. karmat</td>', 'Nice capture of detail, and i like the simplicity of the colors.  Two suggestions, though, that in my opinion, would make it a little stronger, mayber.  First, move the flower over just a touch so tha tyou can''t see the black between the petals in the middle.  Okay, one suggestion, cause then i think that might eliminate cropping the petals out on the right. karmat', '2002-09-22 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
