(122928, 5735, 3208, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best uses if neg. space I have seen here.  The white background is appropriate (and hence makes the photo work well).  Perhpaps the pen is a little too out of fcus for my liking, was the focus intentional?  I like the shadow.  Scores highly for use of neg. space, loses a little because of focus.  Excellent work overall!</td>', 'This is one of the best uses if neg. space I have seen here.  The white background is appropriate (and hence makes the photo work well).  Perhpaps the pen is a little too out of fcus for my liking, was the focus intentional?  I like the shadow.  Scores highly for use of neg. space, loses a little because of focus.  Excellent work overall!', '2002-09-16 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
