(122931, 5735, 772, '<td valign="top">This is really a great idea and the composition is also great... My mind is begging for stronger focus  on this pen, but somehow the softness of it still is quite gripping in some strange way... good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is really a great idea and the composition is also great... My mind is begging for stronger focus  on this pen, but somehow the softness of it still is quite gripping in some strange way... good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
