(123005, 5737, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this use of neg spc, and as such think it is a good photo, however, I find that it does not "engage" my interest a lot.  Perhaps you intended the window to be the "focus" of the shot, but I keep looking through the window for something to focus on, and my eyes just can''t find anywhere to go.  lhall-7</td>', 'I like this use of neg spc, and as such think it is a good photo, however, I find that it does not "engage" my interest a lot.  Perhaps you intended the window to be the "focus" of the shot, but I keep looking through the window for something to focus on, and my eyes just can''t find anywhere to go.  lhall-7', '2002-09-16 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123006, 5737, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge just fine.  I love the greenery outside.  The stickers in the window add noting to this otherwise fine image.  Well, actually the chair would look better if the frame of the window pane didn''t cross it.  Good luck in the challenge...it''s a tough one!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Meets challenge just fine.  I love the greenery outside.  The stickers in the window add noting to this otherwise fine image.  Well, actually the chair would look better if the frame of the window pane didn''t cross it.  Good luck in the challenge...it''s a tough one!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
