(123104, 5747, 2983, '<td valign="top">This is a good black and white photo.  The dingy graininess to it is perfect for the subject matter.  I''m not a fan of long titles, though.  A good photo should be able to stand on its own with the title only making suggestions.  This is definitely a good photo, and a simple title like maybe "Disgusting" would be sufficient.  Titles don''t hurt the scores I give, but it may for others.</td>', 'This is a good black and white photo.  The dingy graininess to it is perfect for the subject matter.  I''m not a fan of long titles, though.  A good photo should be able to stand on its own with the title only making suggestions.  This is definitely a good photo, and a simple title like maybe "Disgusting" would be sufficient.  Titles don''t hurt the scores I give, but it may for others.', '2002-09-16 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
