(123126, 5748, 3112, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, which has many possible angles of philosophical exploration.  But, the focus is a bit loose on the tower detail.  5.5 -&amp;gt; 6</td>', 'An interesting idea, which has many possible angles of philosophical exploration.  But, the focus is a bit loose on the tower detail.  5.5 -&gt; 6', '2002-09-19 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123127, 5748, 3087, '<td valign="top">The expanse of sky here really gives me a feeling of size and space. In that respect it''s negative space and there is a good reason for there being so much of it. Despite that, the picture on it''s own isn''t that striking to me and so I am giving it a 5. I do think it makes a good use of negative space.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'The expanse of sky here really gives me a feeling of size and space. In that respect it''s negative space and there is a good reason for there being so much of it. Despite that, the picture on it''s own isn''t that striking to me and so I am giving it a 5. I do think it makes a good use of negative space.5, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123128, 5748, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good use of neg space with awesome color!  Good luck in the challenge!   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Very good use of neg space with awesome color!  Good luck in the challenge!   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123129, 5748, 3419, '<td valign="top">Wow! The colors are great - the blue is very sharp! Nicely done!</td>', 'Wow! The colors are great - the blue is very sharp! Nicely done!', '2002-09-22 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123130, 5749, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: too busy I dont think this truly represents negative space  4 <br/>Lighting:  good 5,<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk</td>', 'Composition: too busy I dont think this truly represents negative space  4 Lighting:  good 5, Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-16 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123131, 5749, 2867, '<td valign="top">Negative Space?  I dont get the focus in this picture, maybe u can explain it to me.</td>', 'Negative Space?  I dont get the focus in this picture, maybe u can explain it to me.', '2002-09-16 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123132, 5749, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition here. Box on the table, part of the chair, door, light switch....bugs me. HOWEVER-I do see what your going for here. I got it. Good luck, score 6 Justine</td>', 'I don''t like the composition here. Box on the table, part of the chair, door, light switch....bugs me. HOWEVER-I do see what your going for here. I got it. Good luck, score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123133, 5749, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the lighting in this image... I''m not really sure where our negative space is, but that''s ok... *I* am no authority on negative space :)  The dark object in the lower left corner seems a little odd... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the color and the lighting in this image... I''m not really sure where our negative space is, but that''s ok... *I* am no authority on negative space :)  The dark object in the lower left corner seems a little odd... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123134, 5749, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this would have had more of a connection to negative space if the subject were more clear.  The title implies that the subject might be the picture on the wall.  If that is true, then your "negative space" would be everything else.  The phone books aren''t that interesting to me.  I think this would have a higher visual impact if you took the photo of the picture on the wall, with only the wall as the background.  It''s a nice picture, and the wall would make great negative space.  Is there a reason for the phone books? They look as if they were placed there intentionally, however, I can''t find the connection.  The lighting on the "subject" is very nice, and the focus and clarity are great.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I think this would have had more of a connection to negative space if the subject were more clear.  The title implies that the subject might be the picture on the wall.  If that is true, then your "negative space" would be everything else.  The phone books aren''t that interesting to me.  I think this would have a higher visual impact if you took the photo of the picture on the wall, with only the wall as the background.  It''s a nice picture, and the wall would make great negative space.  Is there a reason for the phone books? They look as if they were placed there intentionally, however, I can''t find the connection.  The lighting on the "subject" is very nice, and the focus and clarity are great.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123135, 5749, 1280, '<td valign="top">Not sure where to look here...too many elements.  The picute on the wall would be enough to make  this interesting with the neg space being the wall and door, or table and wall.  The phone books add nothing to the image.  Hope my comments help. Good luck in the challenge...it''s a tough one!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Not sure where to look here...too many elements.  The picute on the wall would be enough to make  this interesting with the neg space being the wall and door, or table and wall.  The phone books add nothing to the image.  Hope my comments help. Good luck in the challenge...it''s a tough one!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123136, 5749, 2158, '<td valign="top">You have tried to fit too much into this photo.</td>', 'You have tried to fit too much into this photo.', '2002-09-16 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123137, 5749, 51167, '<td valign="top">ok, I''m cycling all over this shot trying to figure out what is the focal point in it.  I don''t understand the phonebooks.  There is a cool figure guy on the tv and then the lighted picture.  There is a little too many objects to look at and I"m not getting the wow on any of them cause another item takes away from it. 3</td>', 'ok, I''m cycling all over this shot trying to figure out what is the focal point in it.  I don''t understand the phonebooks.  There is a cool figure guy on the tv and then the lighted picture.  There is a little too many objects to look at and I"m not getting the wow on any of them cause another item takes away from it. 3', '2002-09-17 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123138, 5749, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too much stuff in the foreground methinks</td>', 'Too much stuff in the foreground methinks', '2002-09-17 06:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123139, 5749, 811, '<td valign="top">Could you have made it from a different angle so that it led more to the empty TV screen, or am I totally missing something here?  karmat</td>', 'Could you have made it from a different angle so that it led more to the empty TV screen, or am I totally missing something here?  karmat', '2002-09-18 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123140, 5749, 1759, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t understand this picture at all. The title says that the picture should be the subject, but the phone books seem to be the first thing viewed because of their position and size. Why are they and the TV, table, chair, &amp; door in this shot? This is a rhetorical question and the type that a photographer should ask before any set up shot.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t understand this picture at all. The title says that the picture should be the subject, but the phone books seem to be the first thing viewed because of their position and size. Why are they and the TV, table, chair, & door in this shot? This is a rhetorical question and the type that a photographer should ask before any set up shot.', '2002-09-19 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123141, 5749, 3955, '<td valign="top">love those phonebooks</td>', 'love those phonebooks', '2002-09-20 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123142, 5749, 2109, '<td valign="top">Not much negative space here</td>', 'Not much negative space here', '2002-09-21 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123143, 5749, 2989, '<td valign="top">This photo is so busy and cluttered I can''t possibly see any negative space much less for it be the "wow of the image."</td>', 'This photo is so busy and cluttered I can''t possibly see any negative space much less for it be the "wow of the image."', '2002-09-22 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123144, 5749, 1031, '<td valign="top">Except for the negative aspect of so many dead trees, I don''t think the phone books add to the overall concept or effect. Would like to see the same shot with just the picture, empty chair, and the blank TV.</td>', 'Except for the negative aspect of so many dead trees, I don''t think the phone books add to the overall concept or effect. Would like to see the same shot with just the picture, empty chair, and the blank TV.', '2002-09-22 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123145, 5753, 3402, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I wish the front of the shoes were in better focus....nice use of negative space. cmcvety</td>', 'very nice.  I wish the front of the shoes were in better focus....nice use of negative space. cmcvety', '2002-09-16 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123146, 5753, 51167, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  I like where you cropped this too.  6</td>', 'Great detail.  I like where you cropped this too.  6', '2002-09-16 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123147, 5753, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: too much top grass, not enough bottom 4 <br/>Lighting:  good 5,<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: too much top grass, not enough bottom 4 Lighting:  good 5, Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-16 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123148, 5753, 327, '<td valign="top">Clever, fun, good colors, composition and right on the challenge.......I Like this one.<br/>Good luck. Score 8 Justine</td>', 'Clever, fun, good colors, composition and right on the challenge.......I Like this one.Good luck. Score 8 Justine', '2002-09-16 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123149, 5753, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  I get a real sense of freedom from this.  Someone just took their shoes off and decided to go trotting in the beautiful green grass.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a great picture.  I get a real sense of freedom from this.  Someone just took their shoes off and decided to go trotting in the beautiful green grass.  Great job.', '2002-09-16 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123150, 5753, 3724, '<td valign="top">title makes the picture..........</td>', 'title makes the picture..........', '2002-09-16 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123151, 5753, 1280, '<td valign="top">You seemed to have captured the "Negative space" and color is good.  The image doesn''t reach my creative side though.  Just MY taste I know, so it won''t cost you. Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'You seemed to have captured the "Negative space" and color is good.  The image doesn''t reach my creative side though.  Just MY taste I know, so it won''t cost you. Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123152, 5753, 3127, '<td valign="top">The color is awesome! Great clarity as well.</td>', 'The color is awesome! Great clarity as well.', '2002-09-16 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123153, 5753, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it better with the shoes on top, as if he had stepped forwards out of them. Then the expanse of grass would make more sense.</td>', 'I think I would have liked it better with the shoes on top, as if he had stepped forwards out of them. Then the expanse of grass would make more sense.', '2002-09-16 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123154, 5753, 1664, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Untied laces would have made it more spontaneous.</td>', 'Good photo.  Untied laces would have made it more spontaneous.', '2002-09-16 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123155, 5753, 811, '<td valign="top">the grass really pushes the eyes to teh shoes, very effective.  I like the colors as well. karmat</td>', 'the grass really pushes the eyes to teh shoes, very effective.  I like the colors as well. karmat', '2002-09-20 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123156, 5753, 3112, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I would have added a little entropy to the placement of the shoes for the sake of looking natural (even if it really was this way in real life :)<br/>Focus got a bit soft on you.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I would have added a little entropy to the placement of the shoes for the sake of looking natural (even if it really was this way in real life :)Focus got a bit soft on you.', '2002-09-20 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123157, 5753, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think in this image the positioning of the shoes in the corner of the frame really does add to the impact. The colours are quite soothing and very reminiscent of summer days at the park.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I think in this image the positioning of the shoes in the corner of the frame really does add to the impact. The colours are quite soothing and very reminiscent of summer days at the park.6, Kavey', '2002-09-21 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1);
