(123158, 5753, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea for the challenge -- well done!</td>', 'Very clever idea for the challenge -- well done!', '2002-09-22 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123159, 5753, 3080, '<td valign="top">lighting and angle are great. I love the cropping and placement of the shoes withing the photo.  great use of neg. space.  great clarity. good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'lighting and angle are great. I love the cropping and placement of the shoes withing the photo.  great use of neg. space.  great clarity. good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-09-23 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123160, 5753, 1543, '<td valign="top">thanks to everyone for their comments and critiques.  i didn''t know what negative space was until the challenge.  ;-)  this site has opened my eyes to so many aspects of photography.  good luck in future challenges.</td>', 'thanks to everyone for their comments and critiques.  i didn''t know what negative space was until the challenge.  ;-)  this site has opened my eyes to so many aspects of photography.  good luck in future challenges.', '2002-09-23 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(123161, 5754, 3724, '<td valign="top">I think it is palms overhead...........   a nine</td>', 'I think it is palms overhead...........   a nine', '2002-09-16 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123162, 5754, 1812, '<td valign="top">kinda plain, but good photo none-the-less</td>', 'kinda plain, but good photo none-the-less', '2002-09-16 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123163, 5754, 2553, '<td valign="top">VERY nice !! A perfect example of what I think of as neg spc.   While the shot definitely meets the challenge, and the composition is good,  the shot, overall, doesn''t high visual appeal for me.  lhall-8</td>', 'VERY nice !! A perfect example of what I think of as neg spc.   While the shot definitely meets the challenge, and the composition is good,  the shot, overall, doesn''t high visual appeal for me.  lhall-8', '2002-09-16 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123164, 5754, 327, '<td valign="top">Perfectly done for the challenge. Nice work. Score 7 Justine.</td>', 'Perfectly done for the challenge. Nice work. Score 7 Justine.', '2002-09-16 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123165, 5754, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great work  (more comments later)   10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great work  (more comments later)   10Ruthann', '2002-09-16 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123166, 5754, 3112, '<td valign="top">Nice excution of theme.  Focus a tiny bit soft. Great title.</td>', 'Nice excution of theme.  Focus a tiny bit soft. Great title.', '2002-09-16 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123167, 5754, 2361, '<td valign="top">A beautiful example of working positiver and negative space!  9 Jak</td>', 'A beautiful example of working positiver and negative space!  9 Jak', '2002-09-16 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123168, 5754, 3294, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this... well framed!  - bamaster (7)</td>', 'I like the composition of this... well framed!  - bamaster (7)', '2002-09-17 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123169, 5754, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7 Lighting:  good7<br/> Appeal: 7 Total Rating 7 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: 7 Lighting:  good7 Appeal: 7 Total Rating 7 Sulamk', '2002-09-17 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123170, 5754, 806, '<td valign="top">Cool. Nice detail for a sillouette..</td>', 'Cool. Nice detail for a sillouette..', '2002-09-17 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123171, 5754, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think this is the BEST use of negative space of the lot of them.  There is a balance betwen neg and pos, if you remove the subject, the spaces are interesting in ther own right.  Nice composition, too.  Overall a bit boring, not a picture I''d want to look at over and over.  8</td>', 'I think this is the BEST use of negative space of the lot of them.  There is a balance betwen neg and pos, if you remove the subject, the spaces are interesting in ther own right.  Nice composition, too.  Overall a bit boring, not a picture I''d want to look at over and over.  8', '2002-09-17 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123172, 5754, 835, '<td valign="top">boring...</td>', 'boring...', '2002-09-17 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123173, 5754, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Is that the sky that is the backgroud?  I like the shape of the palm tree, I think that''s what it is. 6</td>', 'Nice.  Is that the sky that is the backgroud?  I like the shape of the palm tree, I think that''s what it is. 6', '2002-09-18 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123174, 5754, 875, '<td valign="top">Terrific abstraction!  I love how the positive and negative spaces mirror each other.</td>', 'Terrific abstraction!  I love how the positive and negative spaces mirror each other.', '2002-09-19 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123175, 5754, 3955, '<td valign="top">very nice, well done!</td>', 'very nice, well done!', '2002-09-20 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123176, 5754, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much.  In fact I have a couple of similar pictures I''ve taken that I like a lot.  Good use of neg space!  Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I like this one very much.  In fact I have a couple of similar pictures I''ve taken that I like a lot.  Good use of neg space!  Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-20 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123177, 5754, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent negative space :)  I like the concept here quite a bit... I would really love it with a nice deep dark blue sky in the background.  I think the weather may not have been opportunistic for it though :)  The composition here is excellent and I love the way you framed this shot... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Excellent negative space :)  I like the concept here quite a bit... I would really love it with a nice deep dark blue sky in the background.  I think the weather may not have been opportunistic for it though :)  The composition here is excellent and I love the way you framed this shot... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-20 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123178, 5754, 1003, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-09-21 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123179, 5754, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the bw on this. karmat</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the bw on this. karmat', '2002-09-22 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123180, 5756, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: very nice dog but I dont think this represents negative space to me  4 <br/>Lighting:  4,<br/> Appeal: 6, Total Rating 5 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: very nice dog but I dont think this represents negative space to me  4 Lighting:  4, Appeal: 6, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-16 05:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123181, 5756, 327, '<td valign="top">Super tones on the b&amp;w, good work. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Super tones on the b&w, good work. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123182, 5756, 2361, '<td valign="top">I think the negativge space would work a lot better in this instyance if the head were completely framed, making it the sole subject/positive.  As it stands right now, the head has to share the space with some uninteresting and unimportant bg material.   5 Jak</td>', 'I think the negativge space would work a lot better in this instyance if the head were completely framed, making it the sole subject/positive.  As it stands right now, the head has to share the space with some uninteresting and unimportant bg material.   5 Jak', '2002-09-16 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123183, 5756, 1280, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite locate that illusive "Neg Space"  BUT  this is a nice pic of a beautiful pooch!  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Can''t quite locate that illusive "Neg Space"  BUT  this is a nice pic of a beautiful pooch!  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123184, 5756, 1041, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry, but in my opinion, this isn''t too much of a negative space photo, the dog takes up most of it and is not enhanced by the background.  but then, the background also doesn''t detract, the photo itself is nice, b&amp;w works, i just wish there was a little catch-light in her eyes. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'i''m sorry, but in my opinion, this isn''t too much of a negative space photo, the dog takes up most of it and is not enhanced by the background.  but then, the background also doesn''t detract, the photo itself is nice, b&w works, i just wish there was a little catch-light in her eyes. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123185, 5756, 3774, '<td valign="top">yes - a nice shot of the dog, but how does it relate to negative space?</td>', 'yes - a nice shot of the dog, but how does it relate to negative space?', '2002-09-16 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123186, 5756, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an EXCELLENT pet portrait.. black and white also works well here..  the detail is excellent :)  I would love to know what part of this image is considered negative space and how it supports the subject... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an EXCELLENT pet portrait.. black and white also works well here..  the detail is excellent :)  I would love to know what part of this image is considered negative space and how it supports the subject... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123187, 5756, 259, '<td valign="top">i feel that the negative space in this photo doesn''t do much to improve the subject or the overall effect.</td>', 'i feel that the negative space in this photo doesn''t do much to improve the subject or the overall effect.', '2002-09-16 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123188, 5756, 3859, '<td valign="top">I love this portrait of the dog. Beautiful.  I can almost hear him panting!  I don''t, however, see the negative space as you did.</td>', 'I love this portrait of the dog. Beautiful.  I can almost hear him panting!  I don''t, however, see the negative space as you did.', '2002-09-16 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123189, 5756, 3112, '<td valign="top">Great technical photo.  Unfortunately it does not incorporate negative space.  I wish it did, because I really really dig the photo, otherwise.<br/></td>', 'Great technical photo.  Unfortunately it does not incorporate negative space.  I wish it did, because I really really dig the photo, otherwise.', '2002-09-17 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123190, 5756, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but background is too cluttered to be negative space (under my own definition, I appreciate your mileage may vary;)<br/>4, Kavey</td>', 'Nice photo but background is too cluttered to be negative space (under my own definition, I appreciate your mileage may vary;)4, Kavey', '2002-09-17 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
