(123197, 5757, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I like the rays coming over the clouds.  It looks like the picture has had some Jpeg compression or something in the clouds. 6</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I like the rays coming over the clouds.  It looks like the picture has had some Jpeg compression or something in the clouds. 6', '2002-09-16 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
