(123199, 5757, 1041, '<td valign="top">this shot qualifies for the challenge, however, your horizon is rather tilted (but not enough to suggest it was done deliberately), and the photo is rather pixelated, probably due to the file being saved at 1/3 of the allowable size.  there are some tutorials on this site to help you maximize the photo quality, i''d also be happy to try and help if you want to send me an email. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'this shot qualifies for the challenge, however, your horizon is rather tilted (but not enough to suggest it was done deliberately), and the photo is rather pixelated, probably due to the file being saved at 1/3 of the allowable size.  there are some tutorials on this site to help you maximize the photo quality, i''d also be happy to try and help if you want to send me an email. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123200, 5757, 2295, '<td valign="top">The focus on this one is a bit too soft.  Also, the picture is a bit crooked.  I like what you were going for here.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'The focus on this one is a bit too soft.  Also, the picture is a bit crooked.  I like what you were going for here.  Meets the challenge.', '2002-09-16 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
