(123214, 5757, 3540, '<td valign="top">The horizon is running a bit uphill from left to right.  IMO, its a little too busy with the sun.  It is a nice shot however</td>', 'The horizon is running a bit uphill from left to right.  IMO, its a little too busy with the sun.  It is a nice shot however', '2002-09-20 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123215, 5757, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and the sky is just beautiful. I''d like the far bank to be horizontal in the frame. Because there is such richness of detail - the silhouettes, the sky and the branches, this doesn''t really feel like a shot with negative space to me. That''s not to say a sunset silhouette couldn''t be, but this one just has so much going on. <br/>I appreciate that this is according to my personal definition of negative space and your mileage may vary ;)<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I like this shot and the sky is just beautiful. I''d like the far bank to be horizontal in the frame. Because there is such richness of detail - the silhouettes, the sky and the branches, this doesn''t really feel like a shot with negative space to me. That''s not to say a sunset silhouette couldn''t be, but this one just has so much going on. I appreciate that this is according to my personal definition of negative space and your mileage may vary ;)5, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123216, 5757, 3955, '<td valign="top">neg space needs to be more pronounced this week. nice photo</td>', 'neg space needs to be more pronounced this week. nice photo', '2002-09-20 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123217, 5757, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent title.  Photo is soft on focus, and exhibits an unfortunate nuber of JPEG artifacts. And, it could be rotated clockwise by about 3-5 degrees.</td>', 'Excellent title.  Photo is soft on focus, and exhibits an unfortunate nuber of JPEG artifacts. And, it could be rotated clockwise by about 3-5 degrees.', '2002-09-20 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123218, 5757, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is sooooooooo pretty and the silhouette is wonderful.  So is the lighting the coloring and the mood.  There is a problem here though.  I''m sure you''ve already heard about it several times.  The horizon is tilted. I do it a lot myself.  There is a solution though.  Just rotate the image and then trim off the excess.  This would have scored very high if it weren''t for the one flaw.  Nice job anyway though.  I like it. Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is sooooooooo pretty and the silhouette is wonderful.  So is the lighting the coloring and the mood.  There is a problem here though.  I''m sure you''ve already heard about it several times.  The horizon is tilted. I do it a lot myself.  There is a solution though.  Just rotate the image and then trim off the excess.  This would have scored very high if it weren''t for the one flaw.  Nice job anyway though.  I like it. Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
