(123363, 5764, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool picture.  One of my tops so far.  Its creative, well conceived and well taken.  Those white spots on his face are distracting.  That''s all I can find wrong with it.</td>', 'This is a very cool picture.  One of my tops so far.  Its creative, well conceived and well taken.  Those white spots on his face are distracting.  That''s all I can find wrong with it.', '2002-09-17 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
