(123365, 5764, 806, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you did here, but the effect is amazing... Some kind of mirror underwater.... but..how, what,... did you,,.ah, ummm....<br/>What is that vertical streak along the right side? Please tell me it''s a seam and not something illegal (not accusing,... just wondering). I could sign this, but... I don''t usually do that.  Nope. gonna go at "face" value. (don''t mind the pun, do you?)</td>', 'I don''t know what you did here, but the effect is amazing... Some kind of mirror underwater.... but..how, what,... did you,,.ah, ummm....What is that vertical streak along the right side? Please tell me it''s a seam and not something illegal (not accusing,... just wondering). I could sign this, but... I don''t usually do that.  Nope. gonna go at "face" value. (don''t mind the pun, do you?)', '2002-09-17 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123366, 5764, 3859, '<td valign="top">I''m still trying to figure out how this was done.  Very clever.</td>', 'I''m still trying to figure out how this was done.  Very clever.', '2002-09-17 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123367, 5764, 3102, '<td valign="top">My top pick for this week!  Very creative... how long did the poor guy have to hold his breath?  I''ll betcha this is Top 3 material.</td>', 'My top pick for this week!  Very creative... how long did the poor guy have to hold his breath?  I''ll betcha this is Top 3 material.', '2002-09-17 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123368, 5764, 1143, '<td valign="top">Well, noone copied this idea anyway  :o)  The weird part is that I know he''s underwater, but his hair looks dry. I love the blue color. Focus &amp; lighting is amazingly good for the situation. What sort of set-up did you use?  ~indigo997</td>', 'Well, noone copied this idea anyway  :o)  The weird part is that I know he''s underwater, but his hair looks dry. I love the blue color. Focus & lighting is amazingly good for the situation. What sort of set-up did you use?  ~indigo997', '2002-09-18 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123369, 5764, 3982, '<td valign="top">This made me think when I first saw it. It''s so clear and bright that if wasn''t for the tiny air bubbles it would make you wonder how it was really done. The water line around the face is perfect. The face of the child has no expression at all like you would expect of someone under water. I really like it.</td>', 'This made me think when I first saw it. It''s so clear and bright that if wasn''t for the tiny air bubbles it would make you wonder how it was really done. The water line around the face is perfect. The face of the child has no expression at all like you would expect of someone under water. I really like it.', '2002-09-18 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123370, 5764, 2781, '<td valign="top">woah! trippy! nice shot</td>', 'woah! trippy! nice shot', '2002-09-18 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
