(123421, 5765, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  The black and white really gives it a "moodiness".  I love how the setting sun is seen in through the truck window.  I think this meets the "negative space" requirement perfectly.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  The black and white really gives it a "moodiness".  I love how the setting sun is seen in through the truck window.  I think this meets the "negative space" requirement perfectly.', '2002-09-16 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
