(123427, 5765, 51, '<td valign="top">I love this! Great shot!</td>', 'I love this! Great shot!', '2002-09-18 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123428, 5765, 1360, '<td valign="top">I almost just clicked on "3" and didn''t take a second look, but i''m glad I did.   Some noise at the top of the image is slightly destracting, but I really like what you did with the sun shining through the windows of this truck.  I think I''d have liked this image more if the truck was completely alone in the lot, with no cars or light pole in the background.  I like the general idea though.  5 -lennier</td>', 'I almost just clicked on "3" and didn''t take a second look, but i''m glad I did.   Some noise at the top of the image is slightly destracting, but I really like what you did with the sun shining through the windows of this truck.  I think I''d have liked this image more if the truck was completely alone in the lot, with no cars or light pole in the background.  I like the general idea though.  5 -lennier', '2002-09-19 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123429, 5765, 2125, '<td valign="top">good shot makes me think what this person was 1. doing and what he is going home too... 9</td>', 'good shot makes me think what this person was 1. doing and what he is going home too... 9', '2002-09-20 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123430, 5765, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is very evocative and moody. I love that feeling of the end of the day, and you have captured every element of it... the light, the feeling of transition from one place to another (usually, if you work somewhere and have to go home), the knowledge that your life is one day further along its weary path... 10 from me - lisae</td>', 'This photo is very evocative and moody. I love that feeling of the end of the day, and you have captured every element of it... the light, the feeling of transition from one place to another (usually, if you work somewhere and have to go home), the knowledge that your life is one day further along its weary path... 10 from me - lisae', '2002-09-20 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123431, 5765, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Excellent idea. Good space usage.</td>', 'Good photo.  Excellent idea. Good space usage.', '2002-09-20 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123432, 5765, 3087, '<td valign="top">Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. Ive voted this image a 7. Kavey</td>', 'Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. Ive voted this image a 7. Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
