(123434, 5765, 1066, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of black and white. I love backlighting and having the sun just peak through the windshield gives a great length to the shadows and life to the photo....9...hokie</td>', 'Excellent use of black and white. I love backlighting and having the sun just peak through the windshield gives a great length to the shadows and life to the photo....9...hokie', '2002-09-22 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123435, 5765, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think you took an essentially boring subject and made it look good enough to call art.  Very nice job!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I think you took an essentially boring subject and made it look good enough to call art.  Very nice job!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123436, 5766, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition:VGood  I think that I would have croppedin tighter on the baby 7 Lighting:  Good  6 ,<br/> Appeal:7, Total Rating 7Sulamk</td>', 'Composition:VGood  I think that I would have croppedin tighter on the baby 7 Lighting:  Good  6 , Appeal:7, Total Rating 7Sulamk', '2002-09-16 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123437, 5766, 2120, '<td valign="top">Looks like it would have been near impossible to avoid, but if you could have taken out the bottom left corner where the edge of the shelf (?) shows it would have completed the feeling of being boxed in better. And the top right. I would have been seriously considering a 9 or a 10 with those two aspects removed. Agamemnon --8</td>', 'Looks like it would have been near impossible to avoid, but if you could have taken out the bottom left corner where the edge of the shelf (?) shows it would have completed the feeling of being boxed in better. And the top right. I would have been seriously considering a 9 or a 10 with those two aspects removed. Agamemnon --8', '2002-09-16 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123438, 5766, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  I am unsure of how well it actually fits the challenge (it is rather vague, the challenge). A little boost in luminance and a boost to contrast would help.</td>', 'Good photo.  I am unsure of how well it actually fits the challenge (it is rather vague, the challenge). A little boost in luminance and a boost to contrast would help.', '2002-09-16 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123439, 5766, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a great pose.  Try to be aware of the edges of your picture.  This probably would have been better if we could see more of the box.  This picture doesn''t really do a good job of illustrating negative space.</td>', 'This is a great pose.  Try to be aware of the edges of your picture.  This probably would have been better if we could see more of the box.  This picture doesn''t really do a good job of illustrating negative space.', '2002-09-16 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
