(123442, 5766, 51167, '<td valign="top">Is he climbing in an entertainment center?  This is a funny shot, but it is a little all round dark. 4</td>', 'Is he climbing in an entertainment center?  This is a funny shot, but it is a little all round dark. 4', '2002-09-17 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
