(123451, 5766, 811, '<td valign="top">future mime?  (sorry, couldn''t resist)  I think a little more light, and a shade more contrast would ahve helped this image have more zing -- it would stand out more i think because the colors wouldn''t be so muted.</td>', 'future mime?  (sorry, couldn''t resist)  I think a little more light, and a shade more contrast would ahve helped this image have more zing -- it would stand out more i think because the colors wouldn''t be so muted.', '2002-09-20 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123452, 5766, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is very cute, good subject, wonderful model, meets challenge, good composition.  I do think it could be improved though, by lightening and a little more contrast.  All in all, good job!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is very cute, good subject, wonderful model, meets challenge, good composition.  I do think it could be improved though, by lightening and a little more contrast.  All in all, good job!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123453, 5770, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice,  I tried to do a couple flame shots once.  I learned that keeping rubbing alcohol in my mouth while I''m trying to light the match and then get my little torch going is not the way to do it.  You should have cropped just a bit more above the flame to get everything in it.  I like how his arms and head are just lit up.  9</td>', 'Nice,  I tried to do a couple flame shots once.  I learned that keeping rubbing alcohol in my mouth while I''m trying to light the match and then get my little torch going is not the way to do it.  You should have cropped just a bit more above the flame to get everything in it.  I like how his arms and head are just lit up.  9', '2002-09-16 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
