(123468, 5770, 3859, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me say "WOW"! Great composition.  I like how the subject is holding his arms.  It gives the picture energy.  Good luck!</td>', 'This photo makes me say "WOW"! Great composition.  I like how the subject is holding his arms.  It gives the picture energy.  Good luck!', '2002-09-17 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123469, 5770, 472, '<td valign="top">right place right time eh?  technical issues: this shot has wide exposure latitude so you exposed for the face but that made much of your fire blow out .. the crop to me is also a little close to the flame.  however you may not have had a chance to do it differently.  9.  mag99</td>', 'right place right time eh?  technical issues: this shot has wide exposure latitude so you exposed for the face but that made much of your fire blow out .. the crop to me is also a little close to the flame.  however you may not have had a chance to do it differently.  9.  mag99', '2002-09-17 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123470, 5770, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo is quite phenomenal.  The only critique I would have on this is trivial to the overall impact of the photo... A shot like this is practically impossible to compose they way you want to, but the flame is too close to the top edge of the frame... The only consequences of that is that matting it for framing would be a challenge... :) great shot... = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo is quite phenomenal.  The only critique I would have on this is trivial to the overall impact of the photo... A shot like this is practically impossible to compose they way you want to, but the flame is too close to the top edge of the frame... The only consequences of that is that matting it for framing would be a challenge... :) great shot... = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-17 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123471, 5770, 2781, '<td valign="top">woah, that''s cool looking!  great detail on the individual droplets.</td>', 'woah, that''s cool looking!  great detail on the individual droplets.', '2002-09-18 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
