(123477, 5770, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks scary. I''d like it even better if there weren''t so much flame (caught earlier in the eruption), or maybe if it hadn''t been quite so bright. But then again, I might end up liking this one better...after the challenge, if it''s OK with you, I''d like to try making an adaptation to this image.</td>', 'Looks scary. I''d like it even better if there weren''t so much flame (caught earlier in the eruption), or maybe if it hadn''t been quite so bright. But then again, I might end up liking this one better...after the challenge, if it''s OK with you, I''d like to try making an adaptation to this image.', '2002-09-20 06:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
