(123482, 5770, 1005, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!  Great timing!  Wouldn''t change a thing.  In fact, you''re getting bumped up one.  I don''t get the negative space, but haven''t gotten it on most pics, so I''m not grading against that this week.  Great photo!  10 Swash</td>', 'Spectacular!  Great timing!  Wouldn''t change a thing.  In fact, you''re getting bumped up one.  I don''t get the negative space, but haven''t gotten it on most pics, so I''m not grading against that this week.  Great photo!  10 Swash', '2002-09-20 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123483, 5770, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this. The way the black vest bleeds into the darkness is great and the way the flame lights his face and skin is wonderful. I like the positioning of his arms, and of him within the frame. The flame has been captured brilliantly and would not be so striking against any other background. I''d like there to be just a hint more black space above the top of the flame so it is more surrounded by the darkness of the frame.<br/>This is an excellent image!<br/>10, Kavey</td>', 'I love this. The way the black vest bleeds into the darkness is great and the way the flame lights his face and skin is wonderful. I like the positioning of his arms, and of him within the frame. The flame has been captured brilliantly and would not be so striking against any other background. I''d like there to be just a hint more black space above the top of the flame so it is more surrounded by the darkness of the frame.This is an excellent image!10, Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123484, 5770, 1037, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo. The shapes here are very dramatic. I''ve been giving out a lot of 10s, but here''s another one :) - lisae</td>', 'Brilliant photo. The shapes here are very dramatic. I''ve been giving out a lot of 10s, but here''s another one :) - lisae', '2002-09-22 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
