(123493, 5771, 772, '<td valign="top">I realy like the way the light plays off the water/sand (mud?) in this image... Here''s a note of interest... 1 - I believe your horizon is a bit too close to center here... In this particular image, *I* would have made the ineteresting detail on the lower portion of my frame a larger part of the image.  2 - the horizon is not level.  I minor rotation would have leveled this up nicely... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I realy like the way the light plays off the water/sand (mud?) in this image... Here''s a note of interest... 1 - I believe your horizon is a bit too close to center here... In this particular image, *I* would have made the ineteresting detail on the lower portion of my frame a larger part of the image.  2 - the horizon is not level.  I minor rotation would have leveled this up nicely... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
