(123508, 5772, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  Tough to work out the lighting, though.  Chrome scooter is too shiny  to make diffuse light out of the flash.  Streetlights and traffic headlights interfere too much.</td>', 'Good concept.  Tough to work out the lighting, though.  Chrome scooter is too shiny  to make diffuse light out of the flash.  Streetlights and traffic headlights interfere too much.', '2002-09-16 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
