(123531, 5773, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very good use of negative space... we all know how tiny and useless a match seems in a big dark place, and you caught that feeling well. Just enough light to illuminate the fingertips and nothing else! Very mysterious and spooky.</td>', 'Very good use of negative space... we all know how tiny and useless a match seems in a big dark place, and you caught that feeling well. Just enough light to illuminate the fingertips and nothing else! Very mysterious and spooky.', '2002-09-20 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123532, 5773, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely close up and detail and translucence to the skin.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely close up and detail and translucence to the skin.6, Kavey', '2002-09-20 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123533, 5773, 3955, '<td valign="top">nice use of theme</td>', 'nice use of theme', '2002-09-20 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123534, 5773, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice fire shot.  I like how close it looks.  7</td>', 'Nice fire shot.  I like how close it looks.  7', '2002-09-21 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123535, 5773, 2427, '<td valign="top">There is another example of this in the challenge, so the unfortunately the originality is diminished.<br/>However, this is better executed and the focus is superb as I can see the grain of the wood in the match.<br/>Nice photo!</td>', 'There is another example of this in the challenge, so the unfortunately the originality is diminished.However, this is better executed and the focus is superb as I can see the grain of the wood in the match.Nice photo!', '2002-09-22 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123536, 5775, 3724, '<td valign="top">An observatory silo or a silage silo?  Space the final frontier or cow food cupboard?         I can''t tell which.</td>', 'An observatory silo or a silage silo?  Space the final frontier or cow food cupboard?         I can''t tell which.', '2002-09-16 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123537, 5775, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition:too much space I would have cropped out the lens flares 4 <br/>Lighting:  5,<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition:too much space I would have cropped out the lens flares 4 Lighting:  5, Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-16 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123538, 5775, 3746, '<td valign="top">Why does the negative space here want me to say "Wow"..</td>', 'Why does the negative space here want me to say "Wow"..', '2002-09-16 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123539, 5775, 1019, '<td valign="top">good feel of space and beyond  good design  andrewm</td>', 'good feel of space and beyond  good design  andrewm', '2002-09-16 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123540, 5775, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot; lens flare and overexposure work well together for this shot. Great use of colour.</td>', 'Great shot; lens flare and overexposure work well together for this shot. Great use of colour.', '2002-09-16 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123541, 5775, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge I''d say!  Would like a more color.  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Meets the challenge I''d say!  Would like a more color.  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123542, 5775, 327, '<td valign="top">I like it, maybe a tad too much glare to the right, but well done. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'I like it, maybe a tad too much glare to the right, but well done. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-16 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123543, 5775, 2344, '<td valign="top">The concept is okay. the negative space is okay.</td>', 'The concept is okay. the negative space is okay.', '2002-09-16 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123544, 5775, 205, '<td valign="top">looks slightly out of focus. and sun spots are on your lense</td>', 'looks slightly out of focus. and sun spots are on your lense', '2002-09-16 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123545, 5775, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot but I think the space becomes the subject rather than the observatory.</td>', 'I like the concept a lot but I think the space becomes the subject rather than the observatory.', '2002-09-16 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123546, 5775, 3294, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo... would have like to see more sharpness on the structure.  I think I would have liked this better without the glare.  Good job.  - bamaster (8)</td>', 'Very nice photo... would have like to see more sharpness on the structure.  I think I would have liked this better without the glare.  Good job.  - bamaster (8)', '2002-09-17 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123547, 5775, 2781, '<td valign="top">i like the lens flare!</td>', 'i like the lens flare!', '2002-09-18 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123548, 5775, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice title for the shot.  I kinda like that lense flare.  The observatory is a little soft.  You should have told them to poke out the telescope so you could take a picture :) 5</td>', 'Nice title for the shot.  I kinda like that lense flare.  The observatory is a little soft.  You should have told them to poke out the telescope so you could take a picture :) 5', '2002-09-18 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123549, 5775, 3087, '<td valign="top">The sky is a nice shade and I actually like the blow out from the sun but need more interest in the main object.<br/>4, Kavey</td>', 'The sky is a nice shade and I actually like the blow out from the sun but need more interest in the main object.4, Kavey', '2002-09-18 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123550, 5775, 3586, '<td valign="top">space station ?</td>', 'space station ?', '2002-09-18 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123551, 5775, 3540, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the sunspots from the glare.  The concept is pretty good though</td>', 'I really don''t like the sunspots from the glare.  The concept is pretty good though', '2002-09-19 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123552, 5775, 3112, '<td valign="top">This would have been staggering at dusk.  The lens flare detracts from the photo, but you get lots of credit for the idea, which meets the challenge technically, and also is a nice play on words. 7.5, which gets rounded up to 8 - mjcecil</td>', 'This would have been staggering at dusk.  The lens flare detracts from the photo, but you get lots of credit for the idea, which meets the challenge technically, and also is a nice play on words. 7.5, which gets rounded up to 8 - mjcecil', '2002-09-19 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123553, 5775, 2983, '<td valign="top">The lens flare is very appropriate for this photo.  A little grainy overall, though.</td>', 'The lens flare is very appropriate for this photo.  A little grainy overall, though.', '2002-09-20 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123554, 5775, 1037, '<td valign="top">This means a lot to me because of the times I''ve spent in observatories. It gives me a real feeling of excitement. I understand what you were trying to convey with this photo, although it probably won''t have that affect on a wide range of people. Well done though.</td>', 'This means a lot to me because of the times I''ve spent in observatories. It gives me a real feeling of excitement. I understand what you were trying to convey with this photo, although it probably won''t have that affect on a wide range of people. Well done though.', '2002-09-21 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123555, 5775, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better at night with stars.</td>', 'I think this would look better at night with stars.', '2002-09-21 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123556, 5775, 811, '<td valign="top">a little sharper focus, or deeper colors may have made this more effective. karmat</td>', 'a little sharper focus, or deeper colors may have made this more effective. karmat', '2002-09-22 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123557, 5775, 3955, '<td valign="top">your picture is divided, lower left/upper right.  you need one focal point</td>', 'your picture is divided, lower left/upper right.  you need one focal point', '2002-09-22 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(123558, 5775, 4008, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge subject perfectly, more empty space than we can see. Lens flare adds to the picture the guide the eye into space. Dome does not appear to be totally sharp.</td>', 'Fits the challenge subject perfectly, more empty space than we can see. Lens flare adds to the picture the guide the eye into space. Dome does not appear to be totally sharp.', '2002-09-22 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123559, 5778, 3540, '<td valign="top">The title says it all.</td>', 'The title says it all.', '2002-09-16 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123560, 5778, 3380, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s my computer, but the image looks elongated.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s my computer, but the image looks elongated.', '2002-09-16 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123561, 5778, 472, '<td valign="top">this is cool. the only thing wrong with it is that it''s stretched. mag99</td>', 'this is cool. the only thing wrong with it is that it''s stretched. mag99', '2002-09-16 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123562, 5778, 1041, '<td valign="top">your photo definitely meets the negative space challenge, even though i don''t think you should ever use ''boring'' in your title unless you want to set yourself up for bad comments.  if you think it''s so boring, maybe you should try and think of another example for negative space.  anyway, this shot looks very much as if it has been resized to fit the challenge dimensions but the proportions have got distorted in the process (the lights are no longer round).  you''ll have to learn to work with your software on how to do this w/out distortion (unless of course this was deliberate and i''m just not getting it).  feel free to send me a message if you''d like for me to help walk you through the steps. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'your photo definitely meets the negative space challenge, even though i don''t think you should ever use ''boring'' in your title unless you want to set yourself up for bad comments.  if you think it''s so boring, maybe you should try and think of another example for negative space.  anyway, this shot looks very much as if it has been resized to fit the challenge dimensions but the proportions have got distorted in the process (the lights are no longer round).  you''ll have to learn to work with your software on how to do this w/out distortion (unless of course this was deliberate and i''m just not getting it).  feel free to send me a message if you''d like for me to help walk you through the steps. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123563, 5778, 917, '<td valign="top">The stretch ruins it, lights aint oval shaped.</td>', 'The stretch ruins it, lights aint oval shaped.', '2002-09-16 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123564, 5778, 772, '<td valign="top">Taking your choice of titles seriously can be beneficial :)  I don''t think this image is boring at all in the context of a negative space subject.  i also think it''s nicely composed.  It appears to have suffered some distortion possibly due to resizing... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Taking your choice of titles seriously can be beneficial :)  I don''t think this image is boring at all in the context of a negative space subject.  i also think it''s nicely composed.  It appears to have suffered some distortion possibly due to resizing... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123565, 5778, 2295, '<td valign="top">Looks like you squeezed the light a bit when you resized it.  Focus is just a bit soft.  The color seems grainy.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like you squeezed the light a bit when you resized it.  Focus is just a bit soft.  The color seems grainy.  Meets the challenge.', '2002-09-16 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123566, 5778, 1175, '<td valign="top">If you know its boring, why do you waste my time submitting it?</td>', 'If you know its boring, why do you waste my time submitting it?', '2002-09-16 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123567, 5778, 1280, '<td valign="top">Although it''s not overly creative, it sure meets this difficult challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Although it''s not overly creative, it sure meets this difficult challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123568, 5778, 327, '<td valign="top">Naw not boring. I like it, just needs more focus for me. Good luck. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Naw not boring. I like it, just needs more focus for me. Good luck. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123569, 5778, 2344, '<td valign="top">I take it this wasn''t your best attempt?</td>', 'I take it this wasn''t your best attempt?', '2002-09-16 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123570, 5778, 835, '<td valign="top">the picture looks like it was stretched.  the lights are oval instead of a circle</td>', 'the picture looks like it was stretched.  the lights are oval instead of a circle', '2002-09-16 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123571, 5778, 1779, '<td valign="top">great title... : )</td>', 'great title... : )', '2002-09-16 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123572, 5778, 2158, '<td valign="top">The shape of the traffic light looks rather distorted.</td>', 'The shape of the traffic light looks rather distorted.', '2002-09-16 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123573, 5778, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice idea,  I wish there was clouds in this one.  The green light beckons to keep on moving.  It is a wierd looking stoplight too bytheway.  Not enough impact for me.  4</td>', 'Nice idea,  I wish there was clouds in this one.  The green light beckons to keep on moving.  It is a wierd looking stoplight too bytheway.  Not enough impact for me.  4', '2002-09-17 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123574, 5778, 3959, '<td valign="top">good.</td>', 'good.', '2002-09-17 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123575, 5778, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5  space 5 Lighting:  good 5,<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: 5  space 5 Lighting:  good 5, Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-17 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123576, 5778, 3580, '<td valign="top">I was going to vote high on this one until I saw the title "boring negative space" Yup, you convinced me. Be careful what you name your pictures.</td>', 'I was going to vote high on this one until I saw the title "boring negative space" Yup, you convinced me. Be careful what you name your pictures.', '2002-09-17 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123577, 5778, 2798, '<td valign="top">It looks like your shot has been stretched vertically which is a little strange. Also perhaps if you pushed the colour saturation up a little it might have been more engaging. 5 - floyd</td>', 'It looks like your shot has been stretched vertically which is a little strange. Also perhaps if you pushed the colour saturation up a little it might have been more engaging. 5 - floyd', '2002-09-18 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123578, 5778, 2867, '<td valign="top">it would''ve been better if u hadn''t stretched it out of shape.  colors are too bland and the title covinces voters even more that its boring.</td>', 'it would''ve been better if u hadn''t stretched it out of shape.  colors are too bland and the title covinces voters even more that its boring.', '2002-09-18 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123579, 5778, 2125, '<td valign="top">yep you got that right LOL</td>', 'yep you got that right LOL', '2002-09-20 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123580, 5778, 2003, '<td valign="top">image looks stretched vertically (oval lights) and oversharpened (light line under pole &amp; splotchy blue indicates overadjusted contrast) - 3</td>', 'image looks stretched vertically (oval lights) and oversharpened (light line under pole & splotchy blue indicates overadjusted contrast) - 3', '2002-09-20 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123581, 5778, 3955, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2002-09-20 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123582, 5778, 2643, '<td valign="top">I think a red light would be more appropriate.</td>', 'I think a red light would be more appropriate.', '2002-09-20 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123583, 5778, 3313, '<td valign="top">Are the traffic lights really this shape has the picture been resized unevenly ? Apart from that I quite like it.</td>', 'Are the traffic lights really this shape has the picture been resized unevenly ? Apart from that I quite like it.', '2002-09-21 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123584, 5778, 3112, '<td valign="top">Color range is good.  Idea is fair.  More practice is needed with your image editor, as you squashed the aspect.  I think your eye is good.  I am looking forward to seeing more submissions from you.</td>', 'Color range is good.  Idea is fair.  More practice is needed with your image editor, as you squashed the aspect.  I think your eye is good.  I am looking forward to seeing more submissions from you.', '2002-09-21 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123585, 5778, 811, '<td valign="top">It almost looks as if you have used a digital zoom on this.  If so, I may have been more beneficial to have the subject smaller, but clearer in the frame.  If not, I don''t know what I''m talking about, so you can ignore this! karmat</td>', 'It almost looks as if you have used a digital zoom on this.  If so, I may have been more beneficial to have the subject smaller, but clearer in the frame.  If not, I don''t know what I''m talking about, so you can ignore this! karmat', '2002-09-22 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123586, 5778, 2427, '<td valign="top">It''s not really boring - actually what it reminds me of is some of those old movies from the ''60s or ''70s where in the intro or the ending, they''d switch off whatever filter/lens they use to make the anamorphic perspective look normal and you''d get this wierd stretch kind of a thing.  It gets kind of grainy looking too, so it''s actually pretty cool in a very subtle way - which is really the coolest of all.<br/>Nice job!</td>', 'It''s not really boring - actually what it reminds me of is some of those old movies from the ''60s or ''70s where in the intro or the ending, they''d switch off whatever filter/lens they use to make the anamorphic perspective look normal and you''d get this wierd stretch kind of a thing.  It gets kind of grainy looking too, so it''s actually pretty cool in a very subtle way - which is really the coolest of all.Nice job!', '2002-09-22 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123587, 5778, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over-sharpened to me. Might have been more "negative" if it were a red light.</td>', 'Looks a little over-sharpened to me. Might have been more "negative" if it were a red light.', '2002-09-22 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123588, 5778, 772, '<td valign="top">boyte, did you intentionally distort this image?  It looks like it has been compresses horizontally... I haven''t seen this issue in your past photos and was just wondering...</td>', 'boyte, did you intentionally distort this image?  It looks like it has been compresses horizontally... I haven''t seen this issue in your past photos and was just wondering...', '2002-09-23 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(123589, 5779, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is a wierd picture.  How did you take this one.  It is a little fuzzy. 5</td>', 'This is a wierd picture.  How did you take this one.  It is a little fuzzy. 5', '2002-09-16 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123590, 5779, 1360, '<td valign="top">This is... strange.  I like the weirded effect though, you''ll have to give details how you did it. 7 -lennier</td>', 'This is... strange.  I like the weirded effect though, you''ll have to give details how you did it. 7 -lennier', '2002-09-16 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123591, 5779, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: cool! how did you do this 8<br/>Lighting:  vgood 6,<br/> Appeal: 8, Total Rating 8 Sulamk</td>', 'Composition: cool! how did you do this 8Lighting:  vgood 6, Appeal: 8, Total Rating 8 Sulamk', '2002-09-16 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123592, 5779, 1037, '<td valign="top">THAT''S SO COOL!!!! This is definitely going to be one of my favourite photos on this site. So spooky and weird. I love it. 10 - lisae</td>', 'THAT''S SO COOL!!!! This is definitely going to be one of my favourite photos on this site. So spooky and weird. I love it. 10 - lisae', '2002-09-16 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
