(123594, 5779, 3080, '<td valign="top">interesting.  so the neg. space is everything but the "alien"?  I think that is fair to say.  without the background (neg. space) the person wouldn''t appear to look like that, so I think you used the neg. space well to achieve the effect of your photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'interesting.  so the neg. space is everything but the "alien"?  I think that is fair to say.  without the background (neg. space) the person wouldn''t appear to look like that, so I think you used the neg. space well to achieve the effect of your photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge. ~hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123595, 5779, 1779, '<td valign="top">very cool use of - space :)</td>', 'very cool use of - space :)', '2002-09-16 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123596, 5779, 259, '<td valign="top">i''ve seen something just like this somewhere, but that doesn''t matter this is awsome.  for sure in my favorites after this is over.</td>', 'i''ve seen something just like this somewhere, but that doesn''t matter this is awsome.  for sure in my favorites after this is over.', '2002-09-16 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123597, 5779, 205, '<td valign="top">you get a ten for making something whimsical</td>', 'you get a ten for making something whimsical', '2002-09-16 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123598, 5779, 2928, '<td valign="top">Really clever shot... Great artistic merit... (10)</td>', 'Really clever shot... Great artistic merit... (10)', '2002-09-17 05:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123599, 5779, 3877, '<td valign="top">excellent shot,,how was this achieved??</td>', 'excellent shot,,how was this achieved??', '2002-09-17 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123600, 5779, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great pic for a horror novel! How''d you do it? The only way I''d know to do it is with PS so I''d like the details on how to do it with the camera. It looks really cool.  ~indigo997</td>', 'Great pic for a horror novel! How''d you do it? The only way I''d know to do it is with PS so I''d like the details on how to do it with the camera. It looks really cool.  ~indigo997', '2002-09-18 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123601, 5779, 3540, '<td valign="top">Its blurry....oh wait I think its supposed to be.  Interesting concept.  Nice -space</td>', 'Its blurry....oh wait I think its supposed to be.  Interesting concept.  Nice -space', '2002-09-18 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123602, 5779, 51, '<td valign="top">... interesting? ...</td>', '... interesting? ...', '2002-09-18 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
