(123604, 5779, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really intriguing photo... I love the concept and would also love to hear how it was done...  great shot :)<br/><br/>Meets Challenge: 8<br/>Technical Merit: 8<br/>Artistic Merit: 7<br/>Creative Merit: 10<br/>WOW Factor: 8<br/><br/>Score: 8 - JMSetzler</td>', 'This is a really intriguing photo... I love the concept and would also love to hear how it was done...  great shot :)Meets Challenge: 8Technical Merit: 8Artistic Merit: 7Creative Merit: 10WOW Factor: 8Score: 8 - JMSetzler', '2002-09-19 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123605, 5779, 1175, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure how you did it but its great.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure how you did it but its great.', '2002-09-19 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123606, 5779, 4058, '<td valign="top">The effect you have achieved here is incredible. I hope you will reveal how you did it.</td>', 'The effect you have achieved here is incredible. I hope you will reveal how you did it.', '2002-09-20 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123607, 5779, 2815, '<td valign="top">This looks allot liek the guy on "Signs"  I don''t know if you caught that movie but it was a really good flick</td>', 'This looks allot liek the guy on "Signs"  I don''t know if you caught that movie but it was a really good flick', '2002-09-20 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(123608, 5779, 82, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  Curious how you did this (is it a reflection?).  The negative space here is cloudy and uncertain, which adds tremendously to the eerie manifestation of this "alien".  It is like the best of the famous shots of Big Foot or the Loch Ness Monster, which are always *just* blurry enough to convince some and frustrate others.  This photo holds my attention again and again.  8</td>', 'Very interesting!  Curious how you did this (is it a reflection?).  The negative space here is cloudy and uncertain, which adds tremendously to the eerie manifestation of this "alien".  It is like the best of the famous shots of Big Foot or the Loch Ness Monster, which are always *just* blurry enough to convince some and frustrate others.  This photo holds my attention again and again.  8', '2002-09-20 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
