(123688, 5783, 47, '<td valign="top">just a suggestion, occasionally it helps to use the selective color and replace color filters (which are legal) in photoshop to enhance colors (blues, greens) and wash out others (magenta, yellow). doing this before despeckling can leave the rest of the photograph less fuzzy, if the noise is uniform enough. or i guess just overexpose a smidgen if the cows arent moving.<br/><br/>this is otherwise a great picture, and that is the reason im taking the time to stop and comment on it.</td>', 'just a suggestion, occasionally it helps to use the selective color and replace color filters (which are legal) in photoshop to enhance colors (blues, greens) and wash out others (magenta, yellow). doing this before despeckling can leave the rest of the photograph less fuzzy, if the noise is uniform enough. or i guess just overexpose a smidgen if the cows arent moving.this is otherwise a great picture, and that is the reason im taking the time to stop and comment on it.', '2002-09-23 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
