(123707, 5784, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the soft focus and the rich colours in this photo. They make the watch seem ethereal, like it blends into the space around it and doesn''t have a really solid, physical existence. And yes, that''s just like a moment in time, which passes from reality into memory and starts to blur at the edges straight away. Very deep :). I''m giving you 10 for making me think - lisae</td>', 'I love the soft focus and the rich colours in this photo. They make the watch seem ethereal, like it blends into the space around it and doesn''t have a really solid, physical existence. And yes, that''s just like a moment in time, which passes from reality into memory and starts to blur at the edges straight away. Very deep :). I''m giving you 10 for making me think - lisae', '2002-09-20 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
