(123752, 5786, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cool picture!  I love that the only color on the grey ground is the flower.  There seems to be some noise in the picture that may be the texture of the neg space, but there is a strange pattern showing up here.  I''d like this better if the subject took up a little more space here.  Still good use of neg space and nice subject.  I hope my personal critique helps and not hurts.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Cool picture!  I love that the only color on the grey ground is the flower.  There seems to be some noise in the picture that may be the texture of the neg space, but there is a strange pattern showing up here.  I''d like this better if the subject took up a little more space here.  Still good use of neg space and nice subject.  I hope my personal critique helps and not hurts.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
