(124017, 5803, 772, '<td valign="top">wow... this would have made a great entry to the fruit/veggie challenge with all those apples :)  Ok.. lemme get this out of my system first... Is this negative space or empty space?  is there a difference? who knows.. I''m sorta lost on this topic myself :)  I do like the shot... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow... this would have made a great entry to the fruit/veggie challenge with all those apples :)  Ok.. lemme get this out of my system first... Is this negative space or empty space?  is there a difference? who knows.. I''m sorta lost on this topic myself :)  I do like the shot... good work :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
