(124023, 5803, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is great!  In my opinion, this is exactly what the challenge was requiring.  The computers are the "negative space" here, helping to bring out the student subject.</td>', 'This is great!  In my opinion, this is exactly what the challenge was requiring.  The computers are the "negative space" here, helping to bring out the student subject.', '2002-09-17 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124024, 5803, 3982, '<td valign="top">I think this meets the challenge very well. It certainly makes the "space around the object just as important as the object itself".</td>', 'I think this meets the challenge very well. It certainly makes the "space around the object just as important as the object itself".', '2002-09-18 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124025, 5803, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  I don''t know how ''negative'' the space is, but the shot is effective.</td>', 'I like the shot.  I don''t know how ''negative'' the space is, but the shot is effective.', '2002-09-18 06:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124026, 5803, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow - great opportunity shot. Well caught! 10 - floyd</td>', 'Wow - great opportunity shot. Well caught! 10 - floyd', '2002-09-18 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124027, 5803, 133, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  Another good example of negative space being busy space.</td>', 'Excellent work.  Another good example of negative space being busy space.', '2002-09-18 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124028, 5803, 2983, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photography, originality sets it apart from the ofther submissions.  Others may tell you it doesnt meet the challenge, but I think it''s perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful photography, originality sets it apart from the ofther submissions.  Others may tell you it doesnt meet the challenge, but I think it''s perfect.', '2002-09-18 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124029, 5803, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. nice repitition effect. 8</td>', 'Excellent shot. nice repitition effect. 8', '2002-09-18 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124030, 5803, 3730, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the subject in your photo is the computers or the girl...very busy photo...2</td>', 'Not sure if the subject in your photo is the computers or the girl...very busy photo...2', '2002-09-19 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124031, 5803, 3161, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - and it''s not just because I like Macs! :) Very pleasing composition - nice almost monochromatic tones. I think this is a good example of how negative space does not have to be a plain texture or single color - the neg space also provides the interesting context for an otherwise humdrum subject. The layout of the other workstations is interesting from a graphic design p of v. I wish the chair at left middle wasn''t there, though. Nice job!</td>', 'I like this a lot - and it''s not just because I like Macs! :) Very pleasing composition - nice almost monochromatic tones. I think this is a good example of how negative space does not have to be a plain texture or single color - the neg space also provides the interesting context for an otherwise humdrum subject. The layout of the other workstations is interesting from a graphic design p of v. I wish the chair at left middle wasn''t there, though. Nice job!', '2002-09-19 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124032, 5803, 1019, '<td valign="top">great shot--the panic is palpable--the only one not to have finished--well done  andrewm</td>', 'great shot--the panic is palpable--the only one not to have finished--well done  andrewm', '2002-09-19 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124033, 5803, 3598, '<td valign="top">Go Macs!...</td>', 'Go Macs!...', '2002-09-19 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124034, 5803, 3742, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Should''nt be better on black and white?</td>', 'Good composition. Should''nt be better on black and white?', '2002-09-19 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124035, 5803, 3112, '<td valign="top">This is awful close to a 10.  I am a little thrown by the intruding window edge at the top of the photo, but the space in this photo accentuates the student''s (ostensibly) daunting and solitary challenges.</td>', 'This is awful close to a 10.  I am a little thrown by the intruding window edge at the top of the photo, but the space in this photo accentuates the student''s (ostensibly) daunting and solitary challenges.', '2002-09-19 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124036, 5803, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least they provide a Mac and a decent-sized monitor...</td>', 'At least they provide a Mac and a decent-sized monitor...', '2002-09-20 06:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124037, 5803, 3880, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I see the negative space, but I love the shot!</td>', 'Not sure if I see the negative space, but I love the shot!', '2002-09-20 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124038, 5803, 1037, '<td valign="top">I know that feeling all too well! *Shudders*. Very good use of space to create that stomach churning feeling that "I''m the only one who hasn''t finished this yet".</td>', 'I know that feeling all too well! *Shudders*. Very good use of space to create that stomach churning feeling that "I''m the only one who hasn''t finished this yet".', '2002-09-20 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
