(124049, 5811, 3080, '<td valign="top">Are those the black jelly beans?  my favorite!!  I think I would have liked this if the "negative space" took up the entire rest of the photo.  As it is, you kind of have 2 negative spaces.  Using the just the beans as the subject, the plate could be the neg. space.  If you included the plate as the subject, then the table would be the neg. space.  I do understand that you meant the beans as the subject and the plate as the neg space.  But then you have this 3rd space that really has no purpose.  I hope that makes sense.  Overall, I think you did a good job.  The lighting is ok, the angle is ok, and the focus is also ok.  Good luck in the challenge. 5 ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Are those the black jelly beans?  my favorite!!  I think I would have liked this if the "negative space" took up the entire rest of the photo.  As it is, you kind of have 2 negative spaces.  Using the just the beans as the subject, the plate could be the neg. space.  If you included the plate as the subject, then the table would be the neg. space.  I do understand that you meant the beans as the subject and the plate as the neg space.  But then you have this 3rd space that really has no purpose.  I hope that makes sense.  Overall, I think you did a good job.  The lighting is ok, the angle is ok, and the focus is also ok.  Good luck in the challenge. 5 ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
