(124128, 5813, 4008, '<td valign="top">Here I do like the black background, unlike most other pictures I see in this challenge. Here it works because the body is also black, leaving the contours of light to paint the lady.</td>', 'Here I do like the black background, unlike most other pictures I see in this challenge. Here it works because the body is also black, leaving the contours of light to paint the lady.', '2002-09-22 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124129, 5813, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit, and I may say a very nice choice of subjects!</td>', 'Very nicely lit, and I may say a very nice choice of subjects!', '2002-09-22 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124130, 5813, 527, '<td valign="top">We might have another winner here. I see a speck that shouldn''t be there. Woops, that''s just dust on my monitor. All that gorgeous black shows that I need to clean my monitor. Fantastic job.<br/><br/>T</td>', 'We might have another winner here. I see a speck that shouldn''t be there. Woops, that''s just dust on my monitor. All that gorgeous black shows that I need to clean my monitor. Fantastic job.T', '2002-09-22 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124131, 5813, 1066, '<td valign="top">What can I say :-)  Beautiful way to catch the human shape and meet the challenge at the same time....so perfect has to have a 10...hokie</td>', 'What can I say :-)  Beautiful way to catch the human shape and meet the challenge at the same time....so perfect has to have a 10...hokie', '2002-09-22 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124132, 5813, 737, '<td valign="top">Simply the best one here. Superb lighting.<br/>A 10.<br/><br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Simply the best one here. Superb lighting.A 10.Jim msp', '2002-09-22 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124133, 5813, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! Mysterious and sensuous!</td>', 'Beautifully done! Mysterious and sensuous!', '2002-09-23 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124134, 5813, 2535, '<td valign="top">nice photo <br/><br/>would have been more effective without her jewelry and if you saw less of her mouth<br/></td>', 'nice photo would have been more effective without her jewelry and if you saw less of her mouth', '2002-10-08 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(124135, 5814, 1829, '<td valign="top">Love the composition.  The black crosses really stand out from the blue background.  Well achieved. (9)</td>', 'Love the composition.  The black crosses really stand out from the blue background.  Well achieved. (9)', '2002-09-16 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124136, 5814, 2553, '<td valign="top">This photo is carries a lot of impact for me strictly through it''s implied message.  I like the composition of the crosses, and the use of neg spc is very good.  lhall-8</td>', 'This photo is carries a lot of impact for me strictly through it''s implied message.  I like the composition of the crosses, and the use of neg spc is very good.  lhall-8', '2002-09-16 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124137, 5814, 327, '<td valign="top">Imapct-bam! Well done. Good luck. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Imapct-bam! Well done. Good luck. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-16 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124138, 5814, 3035, '<td valign="top">i''m not a religious buy but this has a good effect 7 sgtpepper6344</td>', 'i''m not a religious buy but this has a good effect 7 sgtpepper6344', '2002-09-16 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124139, 5814, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the sun. I think you could have given a little less exposure or something and gotten more color from the sky. I like the composition. It''s simple and direct. This is a great example of converging verticals (not sure if that''s good or bad) :o)  I''m not very religious so this doesn''t have much emotional pull for me, but it''s a lovely pic just the same.  ~indigo997</td>', 'Nice placement of the sun. I think you could have given a little less exposure or something and gotten more color from the sky. I like the composition. It''s simple and direct. This is a great example of converging verticals (not sure if that''s good or bad) :o)  I''m not very religious so this doesn''t have much emotional pull for me, but it''s a lovely pic just the same.  ~indigo997', '2002-09-16 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124140, 5814, 259, '<td valign="top">much better than the other cross shot taken for this challenge, in that you only have the sky and nothing else.  nice job.</td>', 'much better than the other cross shot taken for this challenge, in that you only have the sky and nothing else.  nice job.', '2002-09-16 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124141, 5814, 2173, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2002-09-16 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124142, 5814, 3136, '<td valign="top">i like the concept of the sun behind the center cross....</td>', 'i like the concept of the sun behind the center cross....', '2002-09-16 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124143, 5814, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot.  The sun is a little bright in the middle.  I''ve tried to do a shot like this on a building having the sun behind the spire on it and it makes the middle of my shot too bright.  I would have liked this more without the sun and maybe a bluer sky.  5</td>', 'This is a good shot.  The sun is a little bright in the middle.  I''ve tried to do a shot like this on a building having the sun behind the spire on it and it makes the middle of my shot too bright.  I would have liked this more without the sun and maybe a bluer sky.  5', '2002-09-17 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124144, 5814, 3294, '<td valign="top">Gutsy submission.  But it really is a pretty shot!  Well done  - bamaster (7)</td>', 'Gutsy submission.  But it really is a pretty shot!  Well done  - bamaster (7)', '2002-09-17 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124145, 5814, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot... (9)</td>', 'Great shot... (9)', '2002-09-17 05:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124146, 5814, 3669, '<td valign="top">The reason why I like this photo so much is because of the negative space.  The challenge states the the negative space should be the WOW of the photo.  So many people used a bunch of blank space, but this one has the WOW I believe the challege was asking for.  The position of the sun behind the middle cross is very appealing.  It appears that you had divine intervention with the placement of the clouds because they are perfect.  I really envy you being able to come out with such a good shot.  I hope you win</td>', 'The reason why I like this photo so much is because of the negative space.  The challenge states the the negative space should be the WOW of the photo.  So many people used a bunch of blank space, but this one has the WOW I believe the challege was asking for.  The position of the sun behind the middle cross is very appealing.  It appears that you had divine intervention with the placement of the clouds because they are perfect.  I really envy you being able to come out with such a good shot.  I hope you win', '2002-09-17 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124147, 5814, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition:7 Lighting:6<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating7 Sulamk <br/>A new look at this caused me to mark it up the pattern against the sky is very interesting</td>', 'Composition:7 Lighting:6 Appeal: 5, Total Rating7 Sulamk A new look at this caused me to mark it up the pattern against the sky is very interesting', '2002-09-18 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124148, 5814, 3317, '<td valign="top">you need more megapixels.</td>', 'you need more megapixels.', '2002-09-18 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124149, 5814, 4007, '<td valign="top">it''s been done so many times before...</td>', 'it''s been done so many times before...', '2002-09-19 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124150, 5814, 1707, '<td valign="top">very nice; you waited at the perfect time of day for the sunlight</td>', 'very nice; you waited at the perfect time of day for the sunlight', '2002-09-19 05:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124151, 5814, 3598, '<td valign="top">"...on earth...as it is in heaven..."</td>', '"...on earth...as it is in heaven..."', '2002-09-19 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124152, 5814, 3112, '<td valign="top">Classic crucifixion photo.  Sharpness is good, lots of neg space emphasizes the unity of the crosses.</td>', 'Classic crucifixion photo.  Sharpness is good, lots of neg space emphasizes the unity of the crosses.', '2002-09-19 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124153, 5814, 3087, '<td valign="top">Striking shapes. Probably more appealing to someone with a religious connection to them, but maybe not. Because the crosses are in such dark shadow, I can''t see the detail. For this reason, in my interpretation I am seeing the crosses as the negative space, visually, and the sky as the foreground. Either way I''d like to see more detail in the sky/ clouds to give more contrast to the blackness of the crosses.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Striking shapes. Probably more appealing to someone with a religious connection to them, but maybe not. Because the crosses are in such dark shadow, I can''t see the detail. For this reason, in my interpretation I am seeing the crosses as the negative space, visually, and the sky as the foreground. Either way I''d like to see more detail in the sky/ clouds to give more contrast to the blackness of the crosses.5, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124154, 5814, 3955, '<td valign="top">I would try this again on a clear day (I do not think the clouds where your friend here, given the theme).</td>', 'I would try this again on a clear day (I do not think the clouds where your friend here, given the theme).', '2002-09-20 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124155, 5814, 811, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I wanted to do something like this for "From the Ground Up" but couldn''t get three crosses that looked right.  <br/>To really add some *zing*, if you have a polarizer filter, or could deepen the blue of the sky, and make the crosses even darker, it would look nice, I think.  Or convert it to bw to show simple and effective contrast. karmat</td>', 'I love this shot.  I wanted to do something like this for "From the Ground Up" but couldn''t get three crosses that looked right.  To really add some *zing*, if you have a polarizer filter, or could deepen the blue of the sky, and make the crosses even darker, it would look nice, I think.  Or convert it to bw to show simple and effective contrast. karmat', '2002-09-20 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124156, 5814, 1280, '<td valign="top">I won''t be left behind!  :-) So I certainly can associate with this on a spiritual level.   Very nice how you got the sunlight directly behind the biggest cross, presumably Jesus Christ''s cross.  The lighting is so good and you did a good job with the negative space theme.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I won''t be left behind!  :-) So I certainly can associate with this on a spiritual level.   Very nice how you got the sunlight directly behind the biggest cross, presumably Jesus Christ''s cross.  The lighting is so good and you did a good job with the negative space theme.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124157, 5814, 1360, '<td valign="top">Dude, this picture was awesome.  You were robbed.</td>', 'Dude, this picture was awesome.  You were robbed.', '2002-09-24 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(124158, 5816, 1143, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting situation to get good focus. Did you use a tripod and tell him to FREEZE!  :o)  Might be good with him not centered. The really cool part is his face. You don''t need all the extra space around him. His face alone has enough neg space.</td>', 'Tough lighting situation to get good focus. Did you use a tripod and tell him to FREEZE!  :o)  Might be good with him not centered. The really cool part is his face. You don''t need all the extra space around him. His face alone has enough neg space.', '2002-09-16 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124159, 5816, 51167, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t bad.  I don''t know but I just kinda don''t like the red in this.  5</td>', 'This shot isn''t bad.  I don''t know but I just kinda don''t like the red in this.  5', '2002-09-16 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124160, 5816, 3312, '<td valign="top">the shot is great though the scan isnt the best i have seen, the picture looks all dotty</td>', 'the shot is great though the scan isnt the best i have seen, the picture looks all dotty', '2002-09-16 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124161, 5816, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  There is plenty of negative space :)  The soft focus here, i believe, is VERY effective in this situation.  When I look at this image, I am drawn directly to the child''s face.  The interest that i find there is the fact that it is split between light and dark right down the middle.  I believe that this would have been a GREAT composition of just the head and shoulders of this boy in the firelight :)  As the image is presented here, I would have preferred a minor movement of the subject to the right side of the frame to make the entire image more off balance :) - very nice shot and great idea :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  There is plenty of negative space :)  The soft focus here, i believe, is VERY effective in this situation.  When I look at this image, I am drawn directly to the child''s face.  The interest that i find there is the fact that it is split between light and dark right down the middle.  I believe that this would have been a GREAT composition of just the head and shoulders of this boy in the firelight :)  As the image is presented here, I would have preferred a minor movement of the subject to the right side of the frame to make the entire image more off balance :) - very nice shot and great idea :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124162, 5816, 3586, '<td valign="top">spooky</td>', 'spooky', '2002-09-16 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124163, 5816, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job! Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Good job! Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124164, 5816, 327, '<td valign="top">Little more focus ? IMHO, but I don''t dislike this. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Little more focus ? IMHO, but I don''t dislike this. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124165, 5816, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Try moving the kid to one side of the image to help create more mood</td>', 'Very nice. Try moving the kid to one side of the image to help create more mood', '2002-09-16 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124166, 5816, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! Two toned, black &amp; red. Everything about it is compelling. The child''s facial expression perfectly adds to the mood. joanns 10!</td>', 'I love this photo! Two toned, black & red. Everything about it is compelling. The child''s facial expression perfectly adds to the mood. joanns 10!', '2002-09-16 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124167, 5816, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: I would prefer a little less central 6 Lighting:  good 5,<br/> Appeal: 6, Total Rating 6 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: I would prefer a little less central 6 Lighting:  good 5, Appeal: 6, Total Rating 6 Sulamk', '2002-09-17 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124168, 5816, 806, '<td valign="top">Nite shots are tough. Good try. Maybe a longer exposure, and the boy not looking straight into the lens. .. then crop to put the boy on one of the thirds (make  him further right).</td>', 'Nite shots are tough. Good try. Maybe a longer exposure, and the boy not looking straight into the lens. .. then crop to put the boy on one of the thirds (make  him further right).', '2002-09-17 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124169, 5816, 3112, '<td valign="top">Yes, neg space, but it doesn''t have the wow that I''m needing.</td>', 'Yes, neg space, but it doesn''t have the wow that I''m needing.', '2002-09-17 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124170, 5816, 2798, '<td valign="top">I think it would have helped your negative space to move the subject off to one side a little - probably to the right. Nice concept and good colour. I think I''d have tried to bring the subject up a little brighter too. 7 - floyd</td>', 'I think it would have helped your negative space to move the subject off to one side a little - probably to the right. Nice concept and good colour. I think I''d have tried to bring the subject up a little brighter too. 7 - floyd', '2002-09-18 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124171, 5816, 3080, '<td valign="top">definately got some neg space, however the subject its self almost blends in with the neg space, not really jumping out at us.  I think it might have a higher visual impact if the neg space wasn''t cluttered to the left.  however, being a night/dark shot you did a great job.  my camera would have pooped out and left colored speckles all over the place. lol.  the angle and framing are very nice, and the clarity is good.  Overall nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge. 5 ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'definately got some neg space, however the subject its self almost blends in with the neg space, not really jumping out at us.  I think it might have a higher visual impact if the neg space wasn''t cluttered to the left.  however, being a night/dark shot you did a great job.  my camera would have pooped out and left colored speckles all over the place. lol.  the angle and framing are very nice, and the clarity is good.  Overall nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge. 5 ~hbunch7187~', '2002-09-18 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124172, 5816, 2437, '<td valign="top">you could have added some more lights</td>', 'you could have added some more lights', '2002-09-19 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124173, 5816, 3087, '<td valign="top">Atmospheric and the darkness portrays that feeling at campfires, when the scary stories are being shared, and the fire represents safety from the uknown terrors in the darkness. A little too grainy and soft focus for my tastes.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Atmospheric and the darkness portrays that feeling at campfires, when the scary stories are being shared, and the fire represents safety from the uknown terrors in the darkness. A little too grainy and soft focus for my tastes.6, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124174, 5816, 3955, '<td valign="top">that little splash on the left could be cropped out, its a little distracting (i thought my monitor was smudged at first)<br/><br/>nice photo, good implementation of theme</td>', 'that little splash on the left could be cropped out, its a little distracting (i thought my monitor was smudged at first)nice photo, good implementation of theme', '2002-09-20 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124175, 5816, 641, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and hard for some cameras to do. I know I have tried fireside shots and with not very good luck. I really like the expression on his face.</td>', 'Nice shot, and hard for some cameras to do. I know I have tried fireside shots and with not very good luck. I really like the expression on his face.', '2002-09-20 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124176, 5816, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this.  And he looks so innocent sitting there.  karmat</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this.  And he looks so innocent sitting there.  karmat', '2002-09-22 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124177, 5816, 3540, '<td valign="top">My negative space kind of goes without saying.  It was too much space.  I was sort of torn between cropping or not.  My wife''s opinion was to not crop.  So I left it as is.  I like it better this way.  But I think I might have done better if I did.  I was lost Sat. before the challenge.  I figured if I did turn something in, it would be something too produced and sort of cheesy.  I happened to be at a bonfire and saw this shot.  I ordered my son to stay still and had my daughter get the camera.  I took about 10 of him, fixing the exposure after each one.  I took about 10 of my middle son too who is naturally a little more photogenic, but also much more antsy.  I saw this one and knew it was the one.  Problem solved.  Then I submitted it and it started off pretty well.  And as the days passed, it went down and down and down.  I was hoping to do a little better than 160th place.  Thats not something to be proud of.  But I like the shot regardless of what you all think.  I did get a couple of nice comments too.  Thanks to everyone for looking at this.  Thanks for the commenters, good, bad or otherwise.  I need the comments.... I really don''t know what I''m doing good or bad, so they are really beneficial.</td>', 'My negative space kind of goes without saying.  It was too much space.  I was sort of torn between cropping or not.  My wife''s opinion was to not crop.  So I left it as is.  I like it better this way.  But I think I might have done better if I did.  I was lost Sat. before the challenge.  I figured if I did turn something in, it would be something too produced and sort of cheesy.  I happened to be at a bonfire and saw this shot.  I ordered my son to stay still and had my daughter get the camera.  I took about 10 of him, fixing the exposure after each one.  I took about 10 of my middle son too who is naturally a little more photogenic, but also much more antsy.  I saw this one and knew it was the one.  Problem solved.  Then I submitted it and it started off pretty well.  And as the days passed, it went down and down and down.  I was hoping to do a little better than 160th place.  Thats not something to be proud of.  But I like the shot regardless of what you all think.  I did get a couple of nice comments too.  Thanks to everyone for looking at this.  Thanks for the commenters, good, bad or otherwise.  I need the comments.... I really don''t know what I''m doing good or bad, so they are really beneficial.', '2002-09-23 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(124178, 5816, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of picture that doesn''t do well on crappy monitors.  I think that explains a lot of your poor marks.  I wish you had submitted the cropped versions I saw afterwards.   I bet you do too.</td>', 'This is the kind of picture that doesn''t do well on crappy monitors.  I think that explains a lot of your poor marks.  I wish you had submitted the cropped versions I saw afterwards.   I bet you do too.', '2002-09-24 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(124179, 5817, 3669, '<td valign="top">Good action shot...I''m impressed</td>', 'Good action shot...I''m impressed', '2002-09-16 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124180, 5817, 3273, '<td valign="top">I like this!  Full of action yet it satisfies the challenge criteria.  I think your obvious patience has been rewarded with a great photo.  Excellent.</td>', 'I like this!  Full of action yet it satisfies the challenge criteria.  I think your obvious patience has been rewarded with a great photo.  Excellent.', '2002-09-16 04:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124181, 5817, 1812, '<td valign="top">nice action shot!!</td>', 'nice action shot!!', '2002-09-16 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
