(124202, 5817, 3979, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, AND you managed to crop the ground and everything else out of the frame, so it looks like he''s catching air in the middle of nowhere. I like it.</td>', 'Great action shot, AND you managed to crop the ground and everything else out of the frame, so it looks like he''s catching air in the middle of nowhere. I like it.', '2002-09-17 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124203, 5817, 1897, '<td valign="top">I know you only gave me a seven, and I think mine is just as good as yours, but I am still giving you a 9, and I may move it up to 10 when I am done voting.    The composition is great, the lighting is perfect, and you caught the image at the peak of action, is a dynamice pose.  Good work.</td>', 'I know you only gave me a seven, and I think mine is just as good as yours, but I am still giving you a 9, and I may move it up to 10 when I am done voting.    The composition is great, the lighting is perfect, and you caught the image at the peak of action, is a dynamice pose.  Good work.', '2002-09-17 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124204, 5817, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  I''m impressed at how sharp you were able to capture this one!  And the wispy clouds are very nice negative space here.</td>', 'Very well done!  I''m impressed at how sharp you were able to capture this one!  And the wispy clouds are very nice negative space here.', '2002-09-17 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
