(124222, 5817, 82, '<td valign="top">Very dyanmic!  The fact that your subject is fully in the air (no grass or road to be seen) emphasizes the excitement of this stunt.  The fact that your negative space is filled with clouds pushes that excitement further.  Great sprawling of legs and bicycle!  8</td>', 'Very dyanmic!  The fact that your subject is fully in the air (no grass or road to be seen) emphasizes the excitement of this stunt.  The fact that your negative space is filled with clouds pushes that excitement further.  Great sprawling of legs and bicycle!  8', '2002-09-20 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124223, 5817, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a great action shot and the way his leap is frozen with nothing but the sky behind him works very well. The shapes of his body, limbs and bike are fascinating, even as a silhouette. I''d prefer him a wee bit higher in the frame but that''s a minor preference. The inclusion of just a little cloud saves the sky from being too bland a background.<br/>Wonderful image.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'What a great action shot and the way his leap is frozen with nothing but the sky behind him works very well. The shapes of his body, limbs and bike are fascinating, even as a silhouette. I''d prefer him a wee bit higher in the frame but that''s a minor preference. The inclusion of just a little cloud saves the sky from being too bland a background.Wonderful image.9, Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124224, 5817, 2109, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Good use of negative space and good subject!  -9</td>', 'Well done!  Good use of negative space and good subject!  -9', '2002-09-21 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
