(124228, 5817, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice...perfect timing and just very strong image. Definetly in my top few.  In fact I''m giving you a 10.   Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Very nice...perfect timing and just very strong image. Definetly in my top few.  In fact I''m giving you a 10.   Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124229, 5817, 1031, '<td valign="top">This is very dramatic, but I''d feel better if I saw a fully-armored biker. Of course, when discussing motorcycle helmet laws years ago with my dad (a science teacher) he pointed out it was just natural selection -- riders with helmets had a better chance of living to reproduce...<br/><br/>I guess you get a "bonus point" for offering up such a "negative" example...</td>', 'This is very dramatic, but I''d feel better if I saw a fully-armored biker. Of course, when discussing motorcycle helmet laws years ago with my dad (a science teacher) he pointed out it was just natural selection -- riders with helmets had a better chance of living to reproduce...I guess you get a "bonus point" for offering up such a "negative" example...', '2002-09-22 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
