(124284, 5821, 472, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting and imaginative shot .. i like the surface it''s on and how you''ve gotten the background to go dark, giving a sense of space.. very creative, reminds me of something i would see in a video game like quake or unreal : ) .. you should be an artist : ) 8. mag99</td>', 'this is a very interesting and imaginative shot .. i like the surface it''s on and how you''ve gotten the background to go dark, giving a sense of space.. very creative, reminds me of something i would see in a video game like quake or unreal : ) .. you should be an artist : ) 8. mag99', '2002-09-20 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124285, 5821, 3087, '<td valign="top">Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. I will try and leave one either this week or at a later date.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. I will try and leave one either this week or at a later date.6, Kavey', '2002-09-20 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124286, 5821, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good message.  Coloring and exposure are good.  Focus is appropriately sharp. Negative space is used to break up the visually mundane glass.</td>', 'Good message.  Coloring and exposure are good.  Focus is appropriately sharp. Negative space is used to break up the visually mundane glass.', '2002-09-20 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124287, 5821, 811, '<td valign="top">Yahtzee, anyone.  I like how this is lit, and the colors present.  I also think it might look good with the contrast turned way up. karmat</td>', 'Yahtzee, anyone.  I like how this is lit, and the colors present.  I also think it might look good with the contrast turned way up. karmat', '2002-09-20 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124288, 5821, 3955, '<td valign="top">wicked cool</td>', 'wicked cool', '2002-09-20 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124289, 5821, 332, '<td valign="top">Like the framing alot. Good job John. -arnit</td>', 'Like the framing alot. Good job John. -arnit', '2002-09-21 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124290, 5821, 656, '<td valign="top">clean, technically well lit and shot - not sure it really says much to me though.  Slightly disturbed that the glass dissappears towards the upper left. Don''t get the title   - Gordon</td>', 'clean, technically well lit and shot - not sure it really says much to me though.  Slightly disturbed that the glass dissappears towards the upper left. Don''t get the title   - Gordon', '2002-09-21 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124291, 5821, 2152, '<td valign="top">Great color.</td>', 'Great color.', '2002-09-23 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(124292, 5821, 772, '<td valign="top">My idea with this photograph was to make as much of the glass disappear as possible... I setup this glass on black posterboard with black posterboard as a bakcdrop as well.  I filled the glass with water and added one drop of red food coloring.  I made about 75 shots with the light at different positions, and this is the result that I liked best.  <br/><br/>The theme on the "Blood Sport" photo is one of the gambles/risks involved with drinking.  The dice are symbolic of the gamble and the blood red liquid is symbolic of the alcohol and tragedies that are sometimes caused by it.  <br/><br/>This photo scored ok but it didn''t stir up many comments...</td>', 'My idea with this photograph was to make as much of the glass disappear as possible... I setup this glass on black posterboard with black posterboard as a bakcdrop as well.  I filled the glass with water and added one drop of red food coloring.  I made about 75 shots with the light at different positions, and this is the result that I liked best.  The theme on the "Blood Sport" photo is one of the gambles/risks involved with drinking.  The dice are symbolic of the gamble and the blood red liquid is symbolic of the alcohol and tragedies that are sometimes caused by it.  This photo scored ok but it didn''t stir up many comments...', '2002-09-23 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(124293, 5821, 332, '<td valign="top">I thought this picture would do better in this challenge. I liked it alot. Good job John. After hearing your idea it only gets better.<br/><br/>"You are working on a mental level that is above my own and the average voter." ;)</td>', 'I thought this picture would do better in this challenge. I liked it alot. Good job John. After hearing your idea it only gets better."You are working on a mental level that is above my own and the average voter." ;)', '2002-09-23 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
