(124307, 5823, 3859, '<td valign="top">One of the best examples of negative space I have seen. I love the way the colors of the bicyclist stand out against the brown grasses.  I can feel the struggle of his/her journey.  Excellent picture.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'One of the best examples of negative space I have seen. I love the way the colors of the bicyclist stand out against the brown grasses.  I can feel the struggle of his/her journey.  Excellent picture.  A 10 from me.', '2002-09-16 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
