(124309, 5823, 3294, '<td valign="top">Bamaster likes!  Really nice shot... cant see the road at all!  Who knows how many roads are above him?  (8)</td>', 'Bamaster likes!  Really nice shot... cant see the road at all!  Who knows how many roads are above him?  (8)', '2002-09-17 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
