(124312, 5823, 3982, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photo. It gives me a feeling that this cyclist is really all alone out there. It may be just my imagination but the front tire seems to be plowing down the tall grass in front of it as it speeds along.</td>', 'I like the feel of this photo. It gives me a feeling that this cyclist is really all alone out there. It may be just my imagination but the front tire seems to be plowing down the tall grass in front of it as it speeds along.', '2002-09-18 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
