(124322, 5823, 2667, '<td valign="top">the background is the star. love the movement upwards and the swirling arc in front of the cyclist. great shot!  (10)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'the background is the star. love the movement upwards and the swirling arc in front of the cyclist. great shot!  (10)  ~mcmurma', '2002-09-19 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
