(124326, 5823, 3112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of negative space.  Only detractor is the soft focus on the bike, but that could be the resampling step.... 9</td>', 'Beautiful use of negative space.  Only detractor is the soft focus on the bike, but that could be the resampling step.... 9', '2002-09-20 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
