(124328, 5823, 3087, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the grassy land above and below and infront really make this shot by placing the biker so effectively in the environment. The grass works both as an abstract background and as a specific location. The colours and light are good. <br/>Great shot!<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'The inclusion of the grassy land above and below and infront really make this shot by placing the biker so effectively in the environment. The grass works both as an abstract background and as a specific location. The colours and light are good. Great shot!9, Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124329, 5823, 2109, '<td valign="top">YES!  Excellent negative space!, and good contrast with the subject.  -10</td>', 'YES!  Excellent negative space!, and good contrast with the subject.  -10', '2002-09-21 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
