(124380, 5826, 2344, '<td valign="top">I dont mean to sound picky but your negative space is in the wrong place. You want to give the airplane space to move down into (since he''s falling) If the plane were flying sideways it would make sense to keep the space to the side instead of below the plane. This image calls for space below the plane.</td>', 'I dont mean to sound picky but your negative space is in the wrong place. You want to give the airplane space to move down into (since he''s falling) If the plane were flying sideways it would make sense to keep the space to the side instead of below the plane. This image calls for space below the plane.', '2002-09-16 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
