(124404, 5827, 3080, '<td valign="top">I assume that the people are the subject here, and everything else is the neg. space.  The surroundings are beautiful.  You should correct the left tilt in the horizon however.  The lighting is very nice for the mood of this photo.  The sky is beautiful.  The angle and framing, other than the slight tilt, are great.  The focus seems a bit soft for my taste.  almost hard to see that there are 2 people there.   Overall good photo. Good luck in the challenge. 6 ~hbunch7187~</td>', 'I assume that the people are the subject here, and everything else is the neg. space.  The surroundings are beautiful.  You should correct the left tilt in the horizon however.  The lighting is very nice for the mood of this photo.  The sky is beautiful.  The angle and framing, other than the slight tilt, are great.  The focus seems a bit soft for my taste.  almost hard to see that there are 2 people there.   Overall good photo. Good luck in the challenge. 6 ~hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
