(124484, 5833, 2247, '<td valign="top">Your pic is nice.  The only problem is: it''s in dead center.  That''s photo no-no.  Why?  because it is not as pleasing to the eye than if were off-centered.  This is called the rule of thirds. So if you off-center it a little your pic above will get higher ratings.  Good luck.</td>', 'Your pic is nice.  The only problem is: it''s in dead center.  That''s photo no-no.  Why?  because it is not as pleasing to the eye than if were off-centered.  This is called the rule of thirds. So if you off-center it a little your pic above will get higher ratings.  Good luck.', '2002-09-22 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
