(124527, 5835, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great high-key, but it''s a little too blown out. <br/>Would make a great stock shot for advertising. Nice composition and use of neg space.  ~indigo997</td>', 'Great high-key, but it''s a little too blown out. Would make a great stock shot for advertising. Nice composition and use of neg space.  ~indigo997', '2002-09-18 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
