(124529, 5835, 2261, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. The cropping makes this picture very special. The b/w is a good choice. Could see this in a sports shop, have you called Nike? 9-Martin</td>', 'Brilliant. The cropping makes this picture very special. The b/w is a good choice. Could see this in a sports shop, have you called Nike? 9-Martin', '2002-09-18 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124530, 5835, 2798, '<td valign="top">Love the framing and high contrast. Shame it''s blown out that lace in the middle. Otherwise excellent work. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Love the framing and high contrast. Shame it''s blown out that lace in the middle. Otherwise excellent work. 8 - floyd', '2002-09-18 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124531, 5835, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast of this and the bw.  I also think the framing is very effective<br/>karmat</td>', 'I like the high contrast of this and the bw.  I also think the framing is very effectivekarmat', '2002-09-18 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124532, 5835, 1856, '<td valign="top">Love this!  Great composition and contrast...could be a running shoe ad.  10 Lisa</td>', 'Love this!  Great composition and contrast...could be a running shoe ad.  10 Lisa', '2002-09-19 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124533, 5835, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good composition--the feel of the tension is communicated well by the bowing around the photo--great shot  andrewm</td>', 'Good composition--the feel of the tension is communicated well by the bowing around the photo--great shot  andrewm', '2002-09-19 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124534, 5835, 3598, '<td valign="top">Great photo...but is this really negative space?</td>', 'Great photo...but is this really negative space?', '2002-09-19 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124535, 5835, 2172, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. Yes, neg space definately affects the impact of this image.  Great ad photo.  (i''m only making quick comments for scores 8+, sorry)   9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Excellent work. Yes, neg space definately affects the impact of this image.  Great ad photo.  (i''m only making quick comments for scores 8+, sorry)   9Ruthann', '2002-09-19 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124536, 5835, 1827, '<td valign="top">Would make a great ad.  The negative space is entirely appropriate.  8, just-married</td>', 'Would make a great ad.  The negative space is entirely appropriate.  8, just-married', '2002-09-20 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124537, 5835, 1826, '<td valign="top">GREAT job with this challenge! 10 Kaz</td>', 'GREAT job with this challenge! 10 Kaz', '2002-09-20 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124538, 5835, 82, '<td valign="top">The white area adds energy to the shoe and leg.  In our left-to-right culture, moving to the left in motion or still pictures often suggests moving against the flow.  Though nicely lit, I''d like to see a touch more detail in the end of the shoe lace (it almost disappears), and maybe a bit more contrast without overblowing the highlights on the show.  8</td>', 'The white area adds energy to the shoe and leg.  In our left-to-right culture, moving to the left in motion or still pictures often suggests moving against the flow.  Though nicely lit, I''d like to see a touch more detail in the end of the shoe lace (it almost disappears), and maybe a bit more contrast without overblowing the highlights on the show.  8', '2002-09-20 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124539, 5835, 3955, '<td valign="top">good use of theme, composition does nothing for me, sorry</td>', 'good use of theme, composition does nothing for me, sorry', '2002-09-20 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124540, 5835, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good.  Artistic use of NS.</td>', 'Good.  Artistic use of NS.', '2002-09-20 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124541, 5835, 875, '<td valign="top">I love how the arrow-shaped negative space helps imply the concept of motion.</td>', 'I love how the arrow-shaped negative space helps imply the concept of motion.', '2002-09-20 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124542, 5835, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great shot - such an unusual perspective and I like the fat arrow head shape it leaves in the background. My only minor nitpick is the way the blowout on the white means the lace is kind of hard to see and therefore looks almost like dirt spots on the image. A great crop and composition.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'A great shot - such an unusual perspective and I like the fat arrow head shape it leaves in the background. My only minor nitpick is the way the blowout on the white means the lace is kind of hard to see and therefore looks almost like dirt spots on the image. A great crop and composition.8, Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124543, 5835, 527, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative photo. The shoelace hanging out bothers me because the high contrast makes it look like three black spots.<br/><br/>T</td>', 'Interesting and creative photo. The shoelace hanging out bothers me because the high contrast makes it look like three black spots.T', '2002-09-22 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124544, 5835, 1066, '<td valign="top">very nice macro and concept here...8...hokie</td>', 'very nice macro and concept here...8...hokie', '2002-09-22 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124545, 5835, 255, '<td valign="top">wonderful! should be an ad. love it! 10--amitchell</td>', 'wonderful! should be an ad. love it! 10--amitchell', '2002-09-23 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124546, 5836, 327, '<td valign="top">I think this needed better focus, but the composition is sure nice. Good luck. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'I think this needed better focus, but the composition is sure nice. Good luck. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124547, 5836, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this one and the colors are nice too.  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this one and the colors are nice too.  Good luck in the challenge.   Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-16 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124548, 5836, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I almost with the moon wasn''t in the shot though because it distracts from the main subject. 8 joanns</td>', 'I like this a lot. I almost with the moon wasn''t in the shot though because it distracts from the main subject. 8 joanns', '2002-09-16 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124549, 5836, 554, '<td valign="top">Nice shot---This weeks wallpaper---10</td>', 'Nice shot---This weeks wallpaper---10', '2002-09-16 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
