(124566, 5837, 2152, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s a cool billboard and all, but the shot doesn''t really do it for me.</td>', 'I guess it''s a cool billboard and all, but the shot doesn''t really do it for me.', '2002-09-18 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124567, 5837, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of negative space.... the subject of the image seems to be a bit weak to me though... I''m looking for some excitement that is not here :(  the perspective of the guy walking across teh billboard is interesting though :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a good example of negative space.... the subject of the image seems to be a bit weak to me though... I''m looking for some excitement that is not here :(  the perspective of the guy walking across teh billboard is interesting though :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-20 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124568, 5837, 811, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought someone was walking on that!  I like the blues in the picture, but I would recommend possibly cropping more from the bottom, to lose the actual pole, and have more sky. karmat</td>', 'At first glance, I thought someone was walking on that!  I like the blues in the picture, but I would recommend possibly cropping more from the bottom, to lose the actual pole, and have more sky. karmat', '2002-09-20 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
