(124576, 5838, 1041, '<td valign="top">well, 3 dominoes and 11 dots ... but who''s counting.  nice black background, good take on negative space, i like the shadow from the first domino onto the other two, even though i suspect you''ll get comments about that.  only nit is that the light is a little brighter on the first one. -- gr8photos (7)</td>', 'well, 3 dominoes and 11 dots ... but who''s counting.  nice black background, good take on negative space, i like the shadow from the first domino onto the other two, even though i suspect you''ll get comments about that.  only nit is that the light is a little brighter on the first one. -- gr8photos (7)', '2002-09-16 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124577, 5838, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good neg spc.  Good photo, but doesn''t *spark* my interest.   lhall-7</td>', 'Good composition and good neg spc.  Good photo, but doesn''t *spark* my interest.   lhall-7', '2002-09-16 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124578, 5838, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative work. Nice job. Good luck to you. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Creative work. Nice job. Good luck to you. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-16 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124579, 5838, 3313, '<td valign="top">The ivory against the black is very stricking. The composition is great. The only thing which bothers me is the shadow of the 1:1 domino: it distracts a bit. 7</td>', 'The ivory against the black is very stricking. The composition is great. The only thing which bothers me is the shadow of the 1:1 domino: it distracts a bit. 7', '2002-09-16 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124580, 5838, 1759, '<td valign="top">The arrangement is good, but I think that the lighting has some minor problems. The front domino is a bit too hot and I don''t care for the shadow though I realize it would be difficult to get rid of without affecting the dominos in the rear. Better light diffusion and perhaps an additional light source might help with such an arrangement.</td>', 'The arrangement is good, but I think that the lighting has some minor problems. The front domino is a bit too hot and I don''t care for the shadow though I realize it would be difficult to get rid of without affecting the dominos in the rear. Better light diffusion and perhaps an additional light source might help with such an arrangement.', '2002-09-16 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124581, 5838, 3454, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a little hot on front domino, otherwise an interesting shot.</td>', 'Lighting seems a little hot on front domino, otherwise an interesting shot.', '2002-09-17 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124582, 5838, 2928, '<td valign="top">Awesome (10)</td>', 'Awesome (10)', '2002-09-17 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
