(124641, 5841, 1280, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Is this fish jumping out of the water???  I tried to get a few of these shots this week for the "My corner of the World" challenge.  The fish fly out of the water here like crazy when being chased by larger fish.  The image doesn''t clearly show what it is though.  Tough subject to capture.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious<br/></td>', 'WOW!  Is this fish jumping out of the water???  I tried to get a few of these shots this week for the "My corner of the World" challenge.  The fish fly out of the water here like crazy when being chased by larger fish.  The image doesn''t clearly show what it is though.  Tough subject to capture.  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
