(124986, 5863, 51167, '<td valign="top">I had to go back through the entries on the ones that I already voted on, cause this shot looked really familiar.  Someone else did a shot with flowers that looked like this and had a butterfly on it.  Weird.  I like the detail in this one.  Also the colors of those little flower things. This is a beautiful shot.  I still don''t know what kind of flowers those are.  Good shot.  9</td>', 'I had to go back through the entries on the ones that I already voted on, cause this shot looked really familiar.  Someone else did a shot with flowers that looked like this and had a butterfly on it.  Weird.  I like the detail in this one.  Also the colors of those little flower things. This is a beautiful shot.  I still don''t know what kind of flowers those are.  Good shot.  9', '2002-09-22 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
