(124989, 5865, 3208, '<td valign="top">Spooky atmosphere, nice detail of birds'' reflections.  I would have preferred just one bird as I think there is a little too much to look at.  Also, I get shades of green on my monitor, but perhaps my mointor is just crap.</td>', 'Spooky atmosphere, nice detail of birds'' reflections.  I would have preferred just one bird as I think there is a little too much to look at.  Also, I get shades of green on my monitor, but perhaps my mointor is just crap.', '2002-09-16 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(124990, 5865, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is the first photo that came up on my screen to vote on and I''ve been looking at it for a long time, especially since there has been a lot of discussion concerning the defination of negative space.  Definately lots of negative space.  The fog gives it a moody effect.  But for some reason, the birds (your positive) doesn''t seem to relate to the negative.  I don''t really know if this is necessary.  My mind wants to put a lonely boat in the middle of the water/fog.  I gave it a 9 for making me think too hard.  :-)</td>', 'This is the first photo that came up on my screen to vote on and I''ve been looking at it for a long time, especially since there has been a lot of discussion concerning the defination of negative space.  Definately lots of negative space.  The fog gives it a moody effect.  But for some reason, the birds (your positive) doesn''t seem to relate to the negative.  I don''t really know if this is necessary.  My mind wants to put a lonely boat in the middle of the water/fog.  I gave it a 9 for making me think too hard.  :-)', '2002-09-16 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
