(124994, 5865, 3774, '<td valign="top">Total stillness. Really atmospheric. But if i was being picky... tighter composure of the shot to remove the smaller bird in the grassy / reedy bit would have made even more of that all important negative space. but I guess you''d have had to have waited for the birds to move a bit first! cool photo though.</td>', 'Total stillness. Really atmospheric. But if i was being picky... tighter composure of the shot to remove the smaller bird in the grassy / reedy bit would have made even more of that all important negative space. but I guess you''d have had to have waited for the birds to move a bit first! cool photo though.', '2002-09-16 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
