(125028, 5866, 3982, '<td valign="top">I went on a cruise once and was never so sick in my life!! This made me feel queasy the first moment I looked at it. Must be realistic!!! The only thing I could wish for is that the horizon was more colorful and clear but it looks like it was hazy that day so you can''t have everything.</td>', 'I went on a cruise once and was never so sick in my life!! This made me feel queasy the first moment I looked at it. Must be realistic!!! The only thing I could wish for is that the horizon was more colorful and clear but it looks like it was hazy that day so you can''t have everything.', '2002-09-18 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
