(125076, 5869, 1143, '<td valign="top">Great skyscape! I love the colors and mood of this pic. You did a pretty good job of exposing, and focusing on the boat even with the low lighting conditions. I think there is a little too much sky tho. It overwhelms the subject rather than emphasizing it. Try cropping a little more maybe. Also, what is just to the left? Could you have maybe included a little more of the black bars holding up the boat?  ~indigo997</td>', 'Great skyscape! I love the colors and mood of this pic. You did a pretty good job of exposing, and focusing on the boat even with the low lighting conditions. I think there is a little too much sky tho. It overwhelms the subject rather than emphasizing it. Try cropping a little more maybe. Also, what is just to the left? Could you have maybe included a little more of the black bars holding up the boat?  ~indigo997', '2002-09-16 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
