(125241, 5877, 3112, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea.  The photo shows a lot of video-artifacts, though, which may actually be due to overexposure.  Stopping down the lens, if possible could help, as could dropping the EV.</td>', 'Fantastic idea.  The photo shows a lot of video-artifacts, though, which may actually be due to overexposure.  Stopping down the lens, if possible could help, as could dropping the EV.', '2002-09-16 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
