(125248, 5877, 51167, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the sparks.  I like this shot, the lighting and all.  I like this shot how it is, but I wonder how it would look if you took a couple and each time do a faster shutter speed and see if you can just get tiny dots instead of lines.  Just to see what that would look like.  It might make it too dark though.  9</td>', 'I like the look of the sparks.  I like this shot, the lighting and all.  I like this shot how it is, but I wonder how it would look if you took a couple and each time do a faster shutter speed and see if you can just get tiny dots instead of lines.  Just to see what that would look like.  It might make it too dark though.  9', '2002-09-21 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
