(125253, 5878, 3208, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, it has mood.  It involves the viewer by evoking curiosity... ''What is she defying?  Who / What caused her to be in this mood?'' etc. etc.  I like photos which cause me to feel something...  Good neg. space as well.  Good stuff!</td>', 'Interesting photo, it has mood.  It involves the viewer by evoking curiosity... ''What is she defying?  Who / What caused her to be in this mood?'' etc. etc.  I like photos which cause me to feel something...  Good neg. space as well.  Good stuff!', '2002-09-16 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
