(125387, 5885, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the softness of this pic.  THe cat looks so relaxed.  The corners being dark at the top takes away from the nice blue background, though, I afraid (at least for me). karmat</td>', 'I really like the softness of this pic.  THe cat looks so relaxed.  The corners being dark at the top takes away from the nice blue background, though, I afraid (at least for me). karmat', '2002-09-22 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
