(125389, 5885, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful to me. I love the way your cropped it to makethe most of the curves in the cat''s profile. The space makes me wonder what the cat is thinking, and also makes it mysterious. Great work. 10 - lisae</td>', 'This is really beautiful to me. I love the way your cropped it to makethe most of the curves in the cat''s profile. The space makes me wonder what the cat is thinking, and also makes it mysterious. Great work. 10 - lisae', '2002-09-22 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
