(125418, 5887, 641, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot. The colors are perfect, the arrangement is pleasing. The wood contrast is good. Only thing different I might do is use just the big flower and the two smaller ones. I would lose the other one to give the illusion of more space. I might be wrong, but it''s still nice anyway.</td>', 'Really beautiful shot. The colors are perfect, the arrangement is pleasing. The wood contrast is good. Only thing different I might do is use just the big flower and the two smaller ones. I would lose the other one to give the illusion of more space. I might be wrong, but it''s still nice anyway.', '2002-09-20 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
