(125452, 5888, 748, '<td valign="top">Imagine the background with tree branches, leaves etc. The bird would not stand out as it does now.   I used maximum DOF to totally blur the background, leaving only the background colors which contrast with the dominant red color in the bird.  I feel that I used the negative space to the maximum extent and that it created the "wow" of the overall image.</td>', 'Imagine the background with tree branches, leaves etc. The bird would not stand out as it does now.   I used maximum DOF to totally blur the background, leaving only the background colors which contrast with the dominant red color in the bird.  I feel that I used the negative space to the maximum extent and that it created the "wow" of the overall image.', '2002-09-23 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(125453, 5888, 2717, '<td valign="top">I agree!</td>', 'I agree!', '2002-09-23 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
