(125496, 5891, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent message.  my position would be lower, encompassing more of the background, but have the lens opened up wide to shrink DOF, and focus on the crucifix.</td>', 'Excellent message.  my position would be lower, encompassing more of the background, but have the lens opened up wide to shrink DOF, and focus on the crucifix.', '2002-09-20 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125497, 5891, 4049, '<td valign="top">Too white, not enough color variation, not rich or vibrant enough, feels dull and washed out.</td>', 'Too white, not enough color variation, not rich or vibrant enough, feels dull and washed out.', '2002-09-21 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125498, 5891, 2152, '<td valign="top">For some reason this looks like a photograph you''d see on one of those unsolved murder shows.  I''m not sure it''s an optimal use for negative space, though.</td>', 'For some reason this looks like a photograph you''d see on one of those unsolved murder shows.  I''m not sure it''s an optimal use for negative space, though.', '2002-09-23 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125499, 5891, 3102, '<td valign="top">See, you were right -- you weren''t in last place!  You''re movin'' up -- keep at it!  I''ve been seeing your posts in the forums, and you''ve got a great attitude.  I''m sure you''ll see your scores keep going up every week.  :)</td>', 'See, you were right -- you weren''t in last place!  You''re movin'' up -- keep at it!  I''ve been seeing your posts in the forums, and you''ve got a great attitude.  I''m sure you''ll see your scores keep going up every week.  :)', '2002-09-23 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(125500, 5892, 327, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. Two MINOR remarks: the man-/-post were better lit or totally dark---also---the lamp post is leaning. I do like this and love that sky. Good work.<br/>Score 6. Justine</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. Two MINOR remarks: the man-/-post were better lit or totally dark---also---the lamp post is leaning. I do like this and love that sky. Good work.Score 6. Justine', '2002-09-16 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125501, 5892, 3127, '<td valign="top">I think that I would have preferred this shot with just the person and not the lightpost - would have made him seem as though he was floating. I really like the cloud backdrop, though.</td>', 'I think that I would have preferred this shot with just the person and not the lightpost - would have made him seem as though he was floating. I really like the cloud backdrop, though.', '2002-09-16 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125502, 5892, 259, '<td valign="top">the clouds are very nice but the subjects of the photo are lacking in interest.</td>', 'the clouds are very nice but the subjects of the photo are lacking in interest.', '2002-09-16 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
