(125518, 5894, 3208, '<td valign="top">This photo has mood.  It creates interest: ''Who is this person?  Why is he there?'' etc. etc''  This is something I like, as opposed to a viewing an isolated object with loads of neg. space around it.  There''s good use of neg. space here and something beyond that, so a high mark.  Excellent work.</td>', 'This photo has mood.  It creates interest: ''Who is this person?  Why is he there?'' etc. etc''  This is something I like, as opposed to a viewing an isolated object with loads of neg. space around it.  There''s good use of neg. space here and something beyond that, so a high mark.  Excellent work.', '2002-09-16 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
