(125562, 5895, 3955, '<td valign="top">Its an out of focus keyhole at that.  Maybe its not, and you are just getting a bunch of unfortunate reflection and light bleeding in.  In any case I would like it a lot better if you could get it a bit clearer.  Nice idear though!</td>', 'Its an out of focus keyhole at that.  Maybe its not, and you are just getting a bunch of unfortunate reflection and light bleeding in.  In any case I would like it a lot better if you could get it a bit clearer.  Nice idear though!', '2002-09-20 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125563, 5895, 3112, '<td valign="top">I think the idea of NS was lost here.</td>', 'I think the idea of NS was lost here.', '2002-09-21 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125564, 5895, 2221, '<td valign="top">The hole is quite a bit out of focus, which directs the eye to the distance. But the eye finds there nothing (only white overexposure). So I would either focus on the hole or put something interesting to see in the distance behind the hole. -stephan</td>', 'The hole is quite a bit out of focus, which directs the eye to the distance. But the eye finds there nothing (only white overexposure). So I would either focus on the hole or put something interesting to see in the distance behind the hole. -stephan', '2002-09-22 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
