(125608, 5898, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the way the blackness surrounds him and bleeds into the shadows of his face, hat and hands - the darkness really drives us in close to him - the way the light shows us his only his face and hand makes it very intimate. This wouldn''t work with any other background. Feels like a shared moment in time.<br/>10, Kavey</td>', 'I love the way the blackness surrounds him and bleeds into the shadows of his face, hat and hands - the darkness really drives us in close to him - the way the light shows us his only his face and hand makes it very intimate. This wouldn''t work with any other background. Feels like a shared moment in time.10, Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125609, 5898, 2109, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2002-09-21 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125610, 5898, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this! Very dramatic. There''s a really ominous sense that this guy is waiting for something, in the middle of the night, and you wouldn''t know he was there except that he''s lighting that cigarette. 10 - lisae</td>', 'I love this! Very dramatic. There''s a really ominous sense that this guy is waiting for something, in the middle of the night, and you wouldn''t know he was there except that he''s lighting that cigarette. 10 - lisae', '2002-09-22 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
