(125647, 5902, 1897, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, I think that there is too much vacant space.  To me, the purple fading into the black in nice enough.   I think it would be better cropped down into a landscape.  I feel the that too much dead space drowns out the beauty of your subject.   I would like to see more from this shoot.  Zeissman</td>', 'I like this idea, I think that there is too much vacant space.  To me, the purple fading into the black in nice enough.   I think it would be better cropped down into a landscape.  I feel the that too much dead space drowns out the beauty of your subject.   I would like to see more from this shoot.  Zeissman', '2002-09-17 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
