(125658, 5902, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell if you have intentional soft-focus of a little blur from camera-shake. As it shows on my monitor and texture in the sheet is gone just above her shoulder; if it were my shot I''d try to leave the folds showing (if possible) for about another six inches -- assuming I''d been smart enough to think of the shot in the first place...</td>', 'It''s hard to tell if you have intentional soft-focus of a little blur from camera-shake. As it shows on my monitor and texture in the sheet is gone just above her shoulder; if it were my shot I''d try to leave the folds showing (if possible) for about another six inches -- assuming I''d been smart enough to think of the shot in the first place...', '2002-09-22 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
