(125822, 5913, 3087, '<td valign="top">This feels like negative and negative - without a positive. I have seen this idea in art books etc. This one just doesn''t appeal to me. I do like the composition but I think I''d prefer this WITH the guitar in it...<br/>Apologies...<br/>4, Kavey</td>', 'This feels like negative and negative - without a positive. I have seen this idea in art books etc. This one just doesn''t appeal to me. I do like the composition but I think I''d prefer this WITH the guitar in it...Apologies...4, Kavey', '2002-09-17 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
