(125837, 5913, 3178, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. You''ve got the whole ying yang thing here. Plus, let''s face it, the strat shape is just... hot. I think you got probably the ideal framing here too - body, neck, but not giving too much away. My only point of improvement would be the extra stuff at the neck joint. I''m not exactly sure what''s going on there, but it detracts a bit from the overall image. Nice shot, though.. 8. chrisab.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. You''ve got the whole ying yang thing here. Plus, let''s face it, the strat shape is just... hot. I think you got probably the ideal framing here too - body, neck, but not giving too much away. My only point of improvement would be the extra stuff at the neck joint. I''m not exactly sure what''s going on there, but it detracts a bit from the overall image. Nice shot, though.. 8. chrisab.', '2002-09-22 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
