(125858, 5917, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The telephone pole on the left are distracting to my eye, but I can live with it. Nice perspective, nice work. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'I like this very much. The telephone pole on the left are distracting to my eye, but I can live with it. Nice perspective, nice work. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-16 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125859, 5917, 2172, '<td valign="top">Nice work and idea.  For me, this would''ve been more effective by cropping most of the grass out, leaving a very small line across the bottom..was there a reason to leave it in.  To me it is taking away the effect from the cross against the sky.<br/>Great work  (more comments later)    7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Nice work and idea.  For me, this would''ve been more effective by cropping most of the grass out, leaving a very small line across the bottom..was there a reason to leave it in.  To me it is taking away the effect from the cross against the sky.Great work  (more comments later)    7Ruthann', '2002-09-16 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125860, 5917, 2928, '<td valign="top">Moving, stark, superbly composed (10)</td>', 'Moving, stark, superbly composed (10)', '2002-09-16 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125861, 5917, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder if this is a good angle on a small object, or if this is actually one really huge cross.  I think you have used "negative space" properly, and it is appropriate with the subject.  The lighting, angle and focus are great, and so is the framing.  I like how it''s not dead center of the photo.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I have to wonder if this is a good angle on a small object, or if this is actually one really huge cross.  I think you have used "negative space" properly, and it is appropriate with the subject.  The lighting, angle and focus are great, and so is the framing.  I like how it''s not dead center of the photo.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125862, 5917, 2344, '<td valign="top">Negative space is lacking here. Too much going on in the sky/foreground</td>', 'Negative space is lacking here. Too much going on in the sky/foreground', '2002-09-16 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125863, 5917, 259, '<td valign="top">you''re probably getting a lot of comments about this, but the telephone polls on the side take some of the power away from the overall mood and scene.  other than that the photo is very nice.</td>', 'you''re probably getting a lot of comments about this, but the telephone polls on the side take some of the power away from the overall mood and scene.  other than that the photo is very nice.', '2002-09-16 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
