(125899, 5920, 1037, '<td valign="top">That really is negative space :). It''s an interesting homage to one of Mapplethorpe''s Calla Lilly photos. I know the exact one. It helps me to appreciate it in a new way... however, this photo on its own might not stand alone very well if I didn''t know the reference you''re making.</td>', 'That really is negative space :). It''s an interesting homage to one of Mapplethorpe''s Calla Lilly photos. I know the exact one. It helps me to appreciate it in a new way... however, this photo on its own might not stand alone very well if I didn''t know the reference you''re making.', '2002-09-16 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125900, 5920, 327, '<td valign="top">Good work, I like it. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Good work, I like it. Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125901, 5920, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great work  (more comments later)   10<br/>Ruthann   One of the best uses/interpretation of neg space</td>', 'Great work  (more comments later)   10Ruthann   One of the best uses/interpretation of neg space', '2002-09-16 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125902, 5920, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like it, but oddly enough, find that I would prefer to see "something" of the flower, not just a white space.  This gives me the feeling of a drawing (which is a good thing for me!).  lhall-8</td>', 'I like it, but oddly enough, find that I would prefer to see "something" of the flower, not just a white space.  This gives me the feeling of a drawing (which is a good thing for me!).  lhall-8', '2002-09-16 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
