(125926, 5921, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the effect of the shadows here. It feels like the end of a long, hard day at the office.</td>', 'I love the effect of the shadows here. It feels like the end of a long, hard day at the office.', '2002-09-20 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125927, 5921, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the walker is positioned and his shadow before him on the pavement. I don''t know that I am keen on the shadows behind him - I think the paving would work better as negative space without that added detail - if it were all uniform. I am also wondering about whether it would be more interesting to see him walking into the space than out of, though this choice does raise question about what''s infront of him.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I really like the way the walker is positioned and his shadow before him on the pavement. I don''t know that I am keen on the shadows behind him - I think the paving would work better as negative space without that added detail - if it were all uniform. I am also wondering about whether it would be more interesting to see him walking into the space than out of, though this choice does raise question about what''s infront of him.6, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125928, 5921, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  I like how the shadow is angled. 5</td>', 'Nice title.  I like how the shadow is angled. 5', '2002-09-21 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125929, 5921, 3112, '<td valign="top">I know moving shots are hard to compose, but I would have waitied for the man to completely emerge from the shadow. Technically good photo.7</td>', 'I know moving shots are hard to compose, but I would have waitied for the man to completely emerge from the shadow. Technically good photo.7', '2002-09-21 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(125930, 5921, 3955, '<td valign="top">framed poorly</td>', 'framed poorly', '2002-09-22 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
