(125932, 5921, 2152, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I don''t like the shadows here.  I think the image would be stronger without them.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I don''t like the shadows here.  I think the image would be stronger without them.', '2002-09-23 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
