(126135, 5929, 2172, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!!!   Congrats on 4th<br/>Apologies for not finishing my comments earlier.<br/>WOW, this image really shows great use of neg space.  Great composition and overall technically great.  I love the grey and the way that the sky blends into the horizon.  You really feel as if they are in the middle of nowhere.  Great work.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'EXCELLENT!!!   Congrats on 4thApologies for not finishing my comments earlier.WOW, this image really shows great use of neg space.  Great composition and overall technically great.  I love the grey and the way that the sky blends into the horizon.  You really feel as if they are in the middle of nowhere.  Great work.Ruthann', '2002-09-23 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
