(126150, 5930, 772, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful :)  The moon''s presence in the image adds an extremely nice touch... If an eagle or a condor or some other large bird was coming in for a landing here, that would be just amazing too :)  great shot... = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is quite beautiful :)  The moon''s presence in the image adds an extremely nice touch... If an eagle or a condor or some other large bird was coming in for a landing here, that would be just amazing too :)  great shot... = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-17 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126151, 5930, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  The moon is a very cool addition to this one.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  The moon is a very cool addition to this one.', '2002-09-17 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126152, 5930, 3931, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tree and idea.</td>', 'Beautiful tree and idea.', '2002-09-18 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126153, 5930, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The colors are wonderful. The placement of the moon is a bit weird, but I''m not sure if you could have moved a little more to the left or something to fix that. Nice lighting and expsoure. The dark shadows don''t bother me much, but you might try a different time of day to see if you could avoid them. I also think you could have left a little more blue on the right side of the shot. Could you not crop lower? I feel like this is a ledge, but maybe that''s only an illusion. Great work!  10  ~indigo997</td>', 'This is beautiful. The colors are wonderful. The placement of the moon is a bit weird, but I''m not sure if you could have moved a little more to the left or something to fix that. Nice lighting and expsoure. The dark shadows don''t bother me much, but you might try a different time of day to see if you could avoid them. I also think you could have left a little more blue on the right side of the shot. Could you not crop lower? I feel like this is a ledge, but maybe that''s only an illusion. Great work!  10  ~indigo997', '2002-09-18 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126154, 5930, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5 Lighting:  good 5,<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: 5 Lighting:  good 5, Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-18 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126155, 5930, 2295, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I really like how you captured the moon in it.  Focus and lighting are good.  Subject matter is great.  8</td>', 'I like this photo.  I really like how you captured the moon in it.  Focus and lighting are good.  Subject matter is great.  8', '2002-09-18 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126156, 5930, 3287, '<td valign="top">I tried to do something similar but in b&amp;w and was not pleased, you hit it right on the mark, good luck</td>', 'I tried to do something similar but in b&w and was not pleased, you hit it right on the mark, good luck', '2002-09-18 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126157, 5930, 3598, '<td valign="top">Sweet!....</td>', 'Sweet!....', '2002-09-19 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126158, 5930, 1019, '<td valign="top">A beautiful tree--your composition emphasises how remarkable it is to find a tree growing out of a rock--or so it seems.  great shot  andrewm</td>', 'A beautiful tree--your composition emphasises how remarkable it is to find a tree growing out of a rock--or so it seems.  great shot  andrewm', '2002-09-19 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126159, 5930, 2172, '<td valign="top">(i''m only making quick comments for scores 8+, sorry)<br/>Nice work.  Yes, neg space impacts the effect of this photo.  Nice clean sharp image.  great work  10<br/>Ruthann</td>', '(i''m only making quick comments for scores 8+, sorry)Nice work.  Yes, neg space impacts the effect of this photo.  Nice clean sharp image.  great work  10Ruthann', '2002-09-19 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126160, 5930, 1360, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better "zoomed out" a bit, more sky, less rock/tree.  I like this picture, though.  5 -lennier</td>', 'I think this might have worked better "zoomed out" a bit, more sky, less rock/tree.  I like this picture, though.  5 -lennier', '2002-09-19 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
