(126162, 5930, 1280, '<td valign="top">Coloring is nice, and it meets the challenge. Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Coloring is nice, and it meets the challenge. Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-20 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126163, 5930, 3112, '<td valign="top">Bingo.  Possibly my fav, this time around.</td>', 'Bingo.  Possibly my fav, this time around.', '2002-09-20 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126164, 5930, 3955, '<td valign="top">very nice, good balance.  The moon is close enough to the tree not to distract too much from your subject.</td>', 'very nice, good balance.  The moon is close enough to the tree not to distract too much from your subject.', '2002-09-20 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126165, 5930, 641, '<td valign="top">Crop off the bottom to eliminate the cliff and see what you think. I think it looks fantastic that way. The moon in the background just adds a little quirk to it too. Good job.</td>', 'Crop off the bottom to eliminate the cliff and see what you think. I think it looks fantastic that way. The moon in the background just adds a little quirk to it too. Good job.', '2002-09-20 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126166, 5930, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  The moon is a great touch.  Good amount of blank space (not too much!)  That tree has had a hard life.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice photo.  The moon is a great touch.  Good amount of blank space (not too much!)  That tree has had a hard life.  9 Swash', '2002-09-20 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126167, 5930, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and contents of this photo very much. My preference would be for a portrait shot and to have the moon further away from the tree, though this may have been a) not possible or b) completely not what you wanted. Great feeling of being at the top of a tall mountain, growing out on its own... <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I like the colours and contents of this photo very much. My preference would be for a portrait shot and to have the moon further away from the tree, though this may have been a) not possible or b) completely not what you wanted. Great feeling of being at the top of a tall mountain, growing out on its own... 6, Kavey', '2002-09-21 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126168, 5930, 1031, '<td valign="top">Love the extra "space" reference. Need your advice for getting better shots of the moon...</td>', 'Love the extra "space" reference. Need your advice for getting better shots of the moon...', '2002-09-22 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126169, 5930, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - good composition and color. I especially like the moon in the background.</td>', 'Nice photo - good composition and color. I especially like the moon in the background.', '2002-09-22 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126170, 5930, 2834, '<td valign="top">Thank for all your comments.  This was taken as the sun was setting and the moon just happen to be there.  This tree is really amazing.  It''s roots are actually growing out of a rock ledge and just by looking at it you can see the history of it.  In order to get the negative space, I''m below the level of the tree, looking up as I snapped the photo.</td>', 'Thank for all your comments.  This was taken as the sun was setting and the moon just happen to be there.  This tree is really amazing.  It''s roots are actually growing out of a rock ledge and just by looking at it you can see the history of it.  In order to get the negative space, I''m below the level of the tree, looking up as I snapped the photo.', '2002-09-23 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(126171, 5930, 2172, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 13th - Wonderful image</td>', 'Congrats on 13th - Wonderful image', '2002-09-23 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(126172, 5931, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: Plenty of negative space 5 <br/>Lighting:  good 5,<br/> Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: Plenty of negative space 5 Lighting:  good 5, Appeal: 5, Total Rating 5 Sulamk', '2002-09-16 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126173, 5931, 772, '<td valign="top">I see your intention here for negative space.  I can''t really say that the image inspires me much though.  - jmsetzler</td>', 'I see your intention here for negative space.  I can''t really say that the image inspires me much though.  - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126174, 5931, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - that''s the idea as I understand it! Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Nicely done - that''s the idea as I understand it! Score 6 Justine', '2002-09-16 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126175, 5931, 2261, '<td valign="top">Boring.........., can think of no other word, sorry.1-Martin</td>', 'Boring.........., can think of no other word, sorry.1-Martin', '2002-09-16 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126176, 5931, 1041, '<td valign="top">yep, negative space and lots of it, good ''subject'' placement.  i''m sorry, regardless of you meeting the challenge, this shot just isn''t very interesting to me, not enough to hold my attention.  and i''m not sure ufo would''ve come to mind w/out your title.  -- gr8photos.</td>', 'yep, negative space and lots of it, good ''subject'' placement.  i''m sorry, regardless of you meeting the challenge, this shot just isn''t very interesting to me, not enough to hold my attention.  and i''m not sure ufo would''ve come to mind w/out your title.  -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126177, 5931, 3035, '<td valign="top">what is this?  sgtpepper6344</td>', 'what is this?  sgtpepper6344', '2002-09-16 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126178, 5931, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks easy, but I know that it most likely wasn''t.  I know that my camera wouldn''t handle a shot like this.  Nothing really screams WOW, but I do find it interesting.  There is a small dot above the light bar.  Do you have a messed up pixel on your camera? or was this something in the room?  Not much I can say about lighting, other than it seems to serve the purpose of the photo nicely.  I think the focus is good, although not much to focus on. :) I love the placement.  I like how your subject is not directly in the middle of the photo.  Overall simple, but really nice.  Good luck in the challenge. 6 ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'This looks easy, but I know that it most likely wasn''t.  I know that my camera wouldn''t handle a shot like this.  Nothing really screams WOW, but I do find it interesting.  There is a small dot above the light bar.  Do you have a messed up pixel on your camera? or was this something in the room?  Not much I can say about lighting, other than it seems to serve the purpose of the photo nicely.  I think the focus is good, although not much to focus on. :) I love the placement.  I like how your subject is not directly in the middle of the photo.  Overall simple, but really nice.  Good luck in the challenge. 6 ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-09-16 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126179, 5931, 3294, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot... but it just seems forced.  I have no better ideas tho.  Don''t hate me.  - bamaster (5)</td>', 'I like the idea a lot... but it just seems forced.  I have no better ideas tho.  Don''t hate me.  - bamaster (5)', '2002-09-17 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
