(126218, 5934, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a neat shot... I thought this was a big water drop from the thumbnail :)  I can''t make up my mind on the composition... I''m wondering if I would like this shot better in a vertical frame where the candle filled more of the bottom... at any rate, the negative space works nicely here and this is a good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is definitely a neat shot... I thought this was a big water drop from the thumbnail :)  I can''t make up my mind on the composition... I''m wondering if I would like this shot better in a vertical frame where the candle filled more of the bottom... at any rate, the negative space works nicely here and this is a good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-09-20 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
