(126225, 5936, 2764, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t have anything to do with the challange in my book but it is a LOVELY picture otherwise, so how can I score it down?  The colors are perfectly balance and subtle, the composition is tight the lines of the stems intersecting the line if the curb (eventhe curves of the curb) pointing to the beach, End of the summer mood.  Really nice - 9</td>', 'This doesn''t have anything to do with the challange in my book but it is a LOVELY picture otherwise, so how can I score it down?  The colors are perfectly balance and subtle, the composition is tight the lines of the stems intersecting the line if the curb (eventhe curves of the curb) pointing to the beach, End of the summer mood.  Really nice - 9', '2002-09-17 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
