(126383, 5947, 3549, '<td valign="top">neat.  the way the hands are splayed out is very eye catching.  somethign is weird about the elbows, though; once I noticed it I found it kind of distracting/detracting.</td>', 'neat.  the way the hands are splayed out is very eye catching.  somethign is weird about the elbows, though; once I noticed it I found it kind of distracting/detracting.', '2002-09-18 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
