(126385, 5947, 3161, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic design - great hand and finger positions!</td>', 'Nice graphic design - great hand and finger positions!', '2002-09-19 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126386, 5947, 2667, '<td valign="top">is it the vase? is it the hands? you have captured one of the classic negative space definitions in this strong composition. were your model''s hands killing them during this shot...it is a very strange (painful) pose. cool shot.  (9) ~mcmurma</td>', 'is it the vase? is it the hands? you have captured one of the classic negative space definitions in this strong composition. were your model''s hands killing them during this shot...it is a very strange (painful) pose. cool shot.  (9) ~mcmurma', '2002-09-19 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
