(126481, 5951, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition nad content. Not personally keen on the very high contrast in this one, though I do often like it as a graphical tool. Are the shadows at the corners intentional? They put me in mind of older decayed photos in a cherished album, so perhaps they are. I tend to get them when I am at very wide angle with my polariser screwed on, but that''s never deliberate in my case!<br/>The shadow is really interesting in the way it is so soft next to the hardness of the metal.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Nice composition nad content. Not personally keen on the very high contrast in this one, though I do often like it as a graphical tool. Are the shadows at the corners intentional? They put me in mind of older decayed photos in a cherished album, so perhaps they are. I tend to get them when I am at very wide angle with my polariser screwed on, but that''s never deliberate in my case!The shadow is really interesting in the way it is so soft next to the hardness of the metal.6, Kavey', '2002-09-20 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
