(126499, 5952, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the ''tapped out'' theme in this photo.  That lone drip of water hanging on to the fawcet is a really neat element of the photo.  i wish there had been some great way to accent that more, as I feel it will go unnoticed.  The positioning of the fawcet in the frame and the angle also add to the ''tapped out'' theme... it''s like a person turning his head to the side in disgust or exhaustion... good shot :) = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the ''tapped out'' theme in this photo.  That lone drip of water hanging on to the fawcet is a really neat element of the photo.  i wish there had been some great way to accent that more, as I feel it will go unnoticed.  The positioning of the fawcet in the frame and the angle also add to the ''tapped out'' theme... it''s like a person turning his head to the side in disgust or exhaustion... good shot :) = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-18 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
