(126594, 5956, 2643, '<td valign="top">looks set-up</td>', 'looks set-up', '2002-09-20 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126595, 5956, 811, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.  I like how you have lit this.  It really shows the darkness of depression contrasted with the brightness we strive for.  nice work. karmat</td>', 'Powerful image.  I like how you have lit this.  It really shows the darkness of depression contrasted with the brightness we strive for.  nice work. karmat', '2002-09-20 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126596, 5956, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very, very powerful photo. I love the way you used the space to basically represent the man''s mind, and maybe his isolation from other people (I always feel that when I''m truly depressed all the connections between me and other people kind of melt away). I just really want to give that guy a hug! 10 from me - lisae</td>', 'Very, very powerful photo. I love the way you used the space to basically represent the man''s mind, and maybe his isolation from other people (I always feel that when I''m truly depressed all the connections between me and other people kind of melt away). I just really want to give that guy a hug! 10 from me - lisae', '2002-09-21 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126597, 5956, 51167, '<td valign="top">wow, this seems like a powerful shot.  I like how the light just goes dark to the left of him.  Great use of B&amp;W.  Stunning shot. another 10 tonight.</td>', 'wow, this seems like a powerful shot.  I like how the light just goes dark to the left of him.  Great use of B&W.  Stunning shot. another 10 tonight.', '2002-09-21 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126598, 5956, 3087, '<td valign="top">Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. Ive voted this image a 7. Kavey</td>', 'Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. Ive voted this image a 7. Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126599, 5956, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Don''t think I would change a thing.......</td>', 'Very nicely done. Don''t think I would change a thing.......', '2002-09-22 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126600, 5956, 527, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one of the most powerful photos I have seen in a long time. I don''t know if this is set up or not but it doesn''t really. The white t-shirt and facial expression set against the blackness is very impactful. Very very well done. If there was an 11 I would give it to you.<br/><br/>T</td>', 'Wow, this is one of the most powerful photos I have seen in a long time. I don''t know if this is set up or not but it doesn''t really. The white t-shirt and facial expression set against the blackness is very impactful. Very very well done. If there was an 11 I would give it to you.T', '2002-09-22 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126601, 5956, 1280, '<td valign="top">Quite emotive!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Quite emotive!  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-22 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126602, 5956, 1031, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of photos a friend of mine has taken/published. I like the way you kept some detail in the quilt (comforter? is that another "layer of meaning" in this photo?) all the way to the left edge. If you''re interested, I''ll send you a link to his photos...if we allowed dodge/burn functions I''d darken that spot at the base of the big toe...with that change I''d love to see it printed on matte-finish paper.</td>', 'This reminds me of photos a friend of mine has taken/published. I like the way you kept some detail in the quilt (comforter? is that another "layer of meaning" in this photo?) all the way to the left edge. If you''re interested, I''ll send you a link to his photos...if we allowed dodge/burn functions I''d darken that spot at the base of the big toe...with that change I''d love to see it printed on matte-finish paper.', '2002-09-22 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126603, 5956, 509, '<td valign="top">Good personification, Nice lighting as well</td>', 'Good personification, Nice lighting as well', '2002-09-23 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126604, 5957, 51167, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  You might have wanted to do a despeckle to get rid of all the little dots on the shadow. 5</td>', 'I like this one.  You might have wanted to do a despeckle to get rid of all the little dots on the shadow. 5', '2002-09-16 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126605, 5957, 2344, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this down for one reason only. You filled your space with a secondary subject. The point of negative space is to let the viewer imagine what is in the blankness</td>', 'I''m voting this down for one reason only. You filled your space with a secondary subject. The point of negative space is to let the viewer imagine what is in the blankness', '2002-09-16 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126606, 5957, 117, '<td valign="top">nice use of the braces adds flavor too the picturre--9bobgaither</td>', 'nice use of the braces adds flavor too the picturre--9bobgaither', '2002-09-16 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126607, 5957, 3035, '<td valign="top">maybe i''m missing the boat ...</td>', 'maybe i''m missing the boat ...', '2002-09-16 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
