(126614, 5957, 259, '<td valign="top">believe it or not i had an idea very similar to this.  i was going to have someone with panty hoes over his face like a robber, and he was going to be holding a knife like he was about to kill someone.  however, i really like your idea better with the shadow, nice job.</td>', 'believe it or not i had an idea very similar to this.  i was going to have someone with panty hoes over his face like a robber, and he was going to be holding a knife like he was about to kill someone.  however, i really like your idea better with the shadow, nice job.', '2002-09-20 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126615, 5957, 4049, '<td valign="top">I love knife weilding maniacs.</td>', 'I love knife weilding maniacs.', '2002-09-20 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126616, 5957, 1280, '<td valign="top">whew...scary!  Good job meeting the challenge, and original too! Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'whew...scary!  Good job meeting the challenge, and original too! Good luck in  the challenge.  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-20 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126617, 5957, 811, '<td valign="top">at least she really looks scared!  The red shirt really makes this image stand out. karmat</td>', 'at least she really looks scared!  The red shirt really makes this image stand out. karmat', '2002-09-22 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
