(126619, 5958, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble deciding what is the negative space here... if it is the bars, they are competing with the subject for attention... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I''m having trouble deciding what is the negative space here... if it is the bars, they are competing with the subject for attention... - jmsetzler', '2002-09-16 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
