(126621, 5958, 1041, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry, in my opinion, this does not depict negative space, there''s too much going on throughout the picture.  as for the photo itself, i love the shot, the angle of the baseball cap on his head is perfect, and so is the grin.  i would probably crop the right side a bit to remove the person that is partially visible there. -- gr8photos.</td>', 'i''m sorry, in my opinion, this does not depict negative space, there''s too much going on throughout the picture.  as for the photo itself, i love the shot, the angle of the baseball cap on his head is perfect, and so is the grin.  i would probably crop the right side a bit to remove the person that is partially visible there. -- gr8photos.', '2002-09-16 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126622, 5958, 3454, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light and colour, background it too busy to make the negative space pop.</td>', 'Nice natural light and colour, background it too busy to make the negative space pop.', '2002-09-17 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
