(126628, 5958, 4036, '<td valign="top">I believe the contest was called negative space. Unless you think your child has negative space, I don''t see the point.</td>', 'I believe the contest was called negative space. Unless you think your child has negative space, I don''t see the point.', '2002-09-19 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
