(126738, 5966, 3294, '<td valign="top">This is another one of those shots where people will be confused.  I don''t know what it is, neither does anyone else I''ll wager.  For something that is not relatively clear, it needs a title.  The space  has no weight to me.  - bamaster (4)</td>', 'This is another one of those shots where people will be confused.  I don''t know what it is, neither does anyone else I''ll wager.  For something that is not relatively clear, it needs a title.  The space  has no weight to me.  - bamaster (4)', '2002-09-17 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
