(126740, 5966, 3859, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is.  Maybe I am not supposed to know?  Maybe you don''t know and that is why it is untitled?  I like the curve of color against the black but my eyes never relax on the picture as I am constantly searching the shapes on the left to make some sense of it. Although I do like the artsy stuff, this one is just too confusing for me.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is.  Maybe I am not supposed to know?  Maybe you don''t know and that is why it is untitled?  I like the curve of color against the black but my eyes never relax on the picture as I am constantly searching the shapes on the left to make some sense of it. Although I do like the artsy stuff, this one is just too confusing for me.', '2002-09-17 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
