(126750, 5967, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is sort of a "double negative space" isn''t it??!  Nice work, good composition, would have preferred to see the plate without the large shadow on the left side. Overall, good work, but the shot doesn''t carry a lot of impact for me. lhall-6</td>', 'This is sort of a "double negative space" isn''t it??!  Nice work, good composition, would have preferred to see the plate without the large shadow on the left side. Overall, good work, but the shot doesn''t carry a lot of impact for me. lhall-6', '2002-09-16 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126751, 5967, 117, '<td valign="top">i hope that you eat more than that--i like your image and concept--shadows are just right--9bobgaither</td>', 'i hope that you eat more than that--i like your image and concept--shadows are just right--9bobgaither', '2002-09-16 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126752, 5967, 3724, '<td valign="top">round fiesta ware with an olive..........    i love the round motif......    shadows on the interior of the plate/bowl are interesting, no hot-spots, but a boring black border.</td>', 'round fiesta ware with an olive..........    i love the round motif......    shadows on the interior of the plate/bowl are interesting, no hot-spots, but a boring black border.', '2002-09-16 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126753, 5967, 327, '<td valign="top">Mean--lean diet. Cool lighting, composition, creative work. Wish the olive was a bit off center. IMHO Good luck. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Mean--lean diet. Cool lighting, composition, creative work. Wish the olive was a bit off center. IMHO Good luck. Score 7 Justine', '2002-09-16 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126754, 5967, 3786, '<td valign="top">The empty space of this dish transmit exactly the feel of someone on diet :). Good use of the negative space.</td>', 'The empty space of this dish transmit exactly the feel of someone on diet :). Good use of the negative space.', '2002-09-16 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126755, 5967, 1543, '<td valign="top">clever idea, i''m starving!  ;-)</td>', 'clever idea, i''m starving!  ;-)', '2002-09-16 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126756, 5967, 3575, '<td valign="top">at first I smiled then I drank it all in and said outloud, "oh wow".  I think you have three great examples of negative space here. The black is negative space in relation to the plate which is negative space in relation to the olive which is negative space in relation to the pimento! 10!</td>', 'at first I smiled then I drank it all in and said outloud, "oh wow".  I think you have three great examples of negative space here. The black is negative space in relation to the plate which is negative space in relation to the olive which is negative space in relation to the pimento! 10!', '2002-09-16 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126757, 5967, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, very simple, but nice. Lighting is the only real problem that I have with this image. I think that it would be much better if it were lit so as to eliminate the shadows, espescially the distinct shadow from the olive.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, very simple, but nice. Lighting is the only real problem that I have with this image. I think that it would be much better if it were lit so as to eliminate the shadows, espescially the distinct shadow from the olive.', '2002-09-16 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126758, 5967, 3402, '<td valign="top">great use of light and color.  nice shot. cmcvety.</td>', 'great use of light and color.  nice shot. cmcvety.', '2002-09-17 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126759, 5967, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: A bit too central but good 7 Lighting:  good 7,<br/> Appeal: 8 Total Rating 8 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: A bit too central but good 7 Lighting:  good 7, Appeal: 8 Total Rating 8 Sulamk', '2002-09-17 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126760, 5967, 835, '<td valign="top">great idea for the challenge and I like the use of shadows</td>', 'great idea for the challenge and I like the use of shadows', '2002-09-17 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
