(126788, 5968, 1143, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of color so I wish the sky were pink or blue, but this is a great shot nonetheless. You might want to get rid of those limbs on the lower left after the challenge. It''s a great silhouette. The lower right sky is a little blown out. Good Luck. 8  ~indigo997</td>', 'I''m a big fan of color so I wish the sky were pink or blue, but this is a great shot nonetheless. You might want to get rid of those limbs on the lower left after the challenge. It''s a great silhouette. The lower right sky is a little blown out. Good Luck. 8  ~indigo997', '2002-09-18 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126789, 5968, 259, '<td valign="top">i don''t really know, but you may already know this.  technically the picture would probably seem stronger if she were on the left side walking to the right.  that way it doesn''t feel like she is about to leave the shot, unless thats what you were going for.</td>', 'i don''t really know, but you may already know this.  technically the picture would probably seem stronger if she were on the left side walking to the right.  that way it doesn''t feel like she is about to leave the shot, unless thats what you were going for.', '2002-09-18 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126790, 5968, 2567, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 10 Spiller</td>', 'Very nice. 10 Spiller', '2002-09-19 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126791, 5968, 3730, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but the single cloud in the sky distracts from the subject. 6</td>', 'Great picture, but the single cloud in the sky distracts from the subject. 6', '2002-09-19 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126792, 5968, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great cloud coverage!!  Definitely meets the challenge, but I am afraid I will have to take a point off for the sign, it would make a much better shot if it wasnt there,  just imagine the pic withour it.  Nice work. 7 Gmo</td>', 'Great cloud coverage!!  Definitely meets the challenge, but I am afraid I will have to take a point off for the sign, it would make a much better shot if it wasnt there,  just imagine the pic withour it.  Nice work. 7 Gmo', '2002-09-19 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126793, 5968, 2815, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because I can really relate to it.  My grandparents used to have to walk a levee when there town was getting beseiged by the mighty Red River in ND.   One time I was in town with them.  We walked for two hours.  Great pictures</td>', 'I like this shot because I can really relate to it.  My grandparents used to have to walk a levee when there town was getting beseiged by the mighty Red River in ND.   One time I was in town with them.  We walked for two hours.  Great pictures', '2002-09-20 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126794, 5968, 3955, '<td valign="top">minus that sign or whatever it is, this would be fabulous!</td>', 'minus that sign or whatever it is, this would be fabulous!', '2002-09-20 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126795, 5968, 811, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i like the silhouette., karmat</td>', 'very nice.  i like the silhouette., karmat', '2002-09-20 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126796, 5968, 51167, '<td valign="top">nice shadow shot.  I don''t like the sign right in front of him.  A little distracting.  Good shot. 5</td>', 'nice shadow shot.  I don''t like the sign right in front of him.  A little distracting.  Good shot. 5', '2002-09-21 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126797, 5968, 3087, '<td valign="top">Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. Ive voted this image a 6. Kavey</td>', 'Apologies for not leaving a proper comment. Please email me if you''d really like one. Ive voted this image a 6. Kavey', '2002-09-21 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(126798, 5968, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful silhouette :)  I love the photos this week where the subject is the negative space... good idea :)  Compositionally, I would like this photo better if the walker was on the left side of the frame rather than the right.  I don''t know if that was possible in this photo or not however.... When you have a subject that is ''moving'' in the frame, it is usually a good idea to leave space in front of the subject so that the motion has room to ''continue'' in the frame... great shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'beautiful silhouette :)  I love the photos this week where the subject is the negative space... good idea :)  Compositionally, I would like this photo better if the walker was on the left side of the frame rather than the right.  I don''t know if that was possible in this photo or not however.... When you have a subject that is ''moving'' in the frame, it is usually a good idea to leave space in front of the subject so that the motion has room to ''continue'' in the frame... great shot :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-09-21 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
